#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_01_BEHAVIOR
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_01_BEHAVIOR"
msgid "Skittish, introverted, prefers the company of dogs rather than people"
msgstr "Plachá a introvertní; raději tráví čas se psy než s lidmi"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_01_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_01_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Juniper's been training dogs since she was a child. She has trained dogs for"
" agility and self-defense, but now she considers hunting the ultimate "
"challenge because she likes to put the dog to the test in a category they "
"were bred for."
msgstr ""
"Juniper cvičí psy od dětství. Věnovala se s nimi agility i sebeobraně, dnes "
"však považuje lov za největší výzvu. Může při něm prověřit schopnosti, pro "
"které byla jednotlivá plemena vyšlechtěna."

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_01_LIFECYCLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
