msgid "Active during 8:00-17:00"
msgstr "Aktivní od 8:00 do 17:00"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_01_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_01_NAME"
msgid "Juniper"
msgstr "Juniper"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_01_OCCUPATION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_01_OCCUPATION"
msgid "Dog trainer"
msgstr "Cvičitelka psů"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_01_STRENGTH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_01_STRENGTH"
msgid "Best dog trainer in the United States, dog whisperer?"
msgstr "Nejlepší cvičitelka psů ve Spojených státech. Psí našeptávačka?"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_01_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_01_TRIVIA01"
msgid ""
"Juniper and her dog, Bug, both have heterochromia, which means that they "
"have different-colored eyes."
msgstr "Juniper i její fena Bug mají heterochromii: každé oko má jinou barvu."

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_01_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_01_TRIVIA02"
msgid ""
"Juniper suffers from sleep paralysis, but it's improving thanks to Bug. "
"She's been training her as a service dog to monitor her condition."
msgstr ""
"Juniper trpí spánkovou paralýzou, ale díky feně Bug se její stav zlepšuje. "
"Cvičí ji jako asistenčního psa, který bude její stav sledovat."

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_01_WEAKNESS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_01_WEAKNESS"
msgid "Low self-esteem"
msgstr "Nízké sebevědomí"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_04_BEHAVIOR
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_04_BEHAVIOR"
msgid "Courageous, extroverted. Prefers to hunt for attention in packs."
msgstr "Odvážný extrovert. Ve skupině na sebe rád strhává pozornost."

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_04_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_04_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Patrick is a warden of New Laurentia, always looking for ways to promote the reserve. You'll often see him in pink glasses, a furry coat, and with a well-groomed, stylish beard.\n"
"\n"
"Recently, he went through what his wife jokingly calls an \"end-life crisis.\" He started buying high-end gadgets for fun and completely overhauled his wardrobe. Now he brightens up every space he enters with his personality. He doesn’t shy away from being the center of attention and somehow manages to even [i]sound[/i] louder."
msgstr ""
"Patrick je správcem rezervace New Laurentia a neustále hledá způsoby, jak ji propagovat. Často ho potkáte v růžových brýlích a kožešinovém kabátě, s pečlivě upraveným plnovousem.\n"
"\n"
"Nedávno si prošel tím, čemu jeho žena žertem říká „krize na sklonku života“. Pro radost si začal pořizovat luxusní přístroje a kompletně obměnil šatník. Svou osobností teď rozzáří každou místnost. Rád je středem pozornosti a nějak dokáže dokonce [i]znít[/i] hlasitěji."

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_04_LIFECYCLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_04_LIFECYCLE"
msgid "Active during 05:00-23:00"
msgstr "Aktivní od 5:00 do 23:00"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_04_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_04_NAME"
msgid "Patrick Harper"
msgstr "Patrick Harper"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_04_OCCUPATION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_04_OCCUPATION"
msgid "Warden of New Laurentia"
msgstr "Správce rezervace New Laurentia"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_04_STRENGTH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_04_STRENGTH"
msgid "Unyielding spirit"
msgstr "Nezlomnost"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_04_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_04_TRIVIA01"
msgid ""
"Patrick became best friends with Malachi Burnett on the Hearth & Hunt forum,"
" without ever meeting in person! They bonded over meat aging techniques."
msgstr ""
"Patrick a Malachi Burnett se stali nejlepšími přáteli na fóru Hearth & Hunt,"
" ačkoli se nikdy osobně nesetkali. Spojil je zájem o postupy zrání masa."

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_04_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_04_TRIVIA02"
msgid ""
"Patrick fell in love with his wife Regina after she predicted his death and "
"then saved him."
msgstr ""
"Patrick se do Reginy zamiloval poté, co mu předpověděla smrt a zachránila "
"ho."

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_04_WEAKNESS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_04_WEAKNESS"
msgid "Bad with technology"
msgstr "Nerozumí technice"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_05_BEHAVIOR
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_05_BEHAVIOR"
msgid "Leader of the pack, courageous, prefers to live in the forest"
msgstr "Odvážná vůdkyně skupiny, nejraději žije v lese"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_05_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_05_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Often called \"the beating heart of New Laurentia,\" and it still doesn't do her justice. She's in charge of habitat enhancement and animal welfare in the reserve, though her methods are anything but conventional. \n"
"Regina relies heavily on her intuition, dreams and a deep sense of spirituality.\n"
"\n"
"She believes that nature is the most powerful force in the world and that humans should serve it instead of trying to control it. Lately, however, a quiet melancholy has taken hold of her. She feels her husband is growing more distant and she can’t understand why. To cope, she throws herself even deeper into her work—which is great for us!"
msgstr ""
"Regina bývá označována za „tlukoucí srdce New Laurentia“, ale ani to ji plně nevystihuje. V rezervaci se stará o zlepšování prostředí a blaho zvěře, její metody jsou však všechno, jen ne obvyklé. Řídí se intuicí, sny a hlubokým duchovním přesvědčením.\n"
"\n"
"Věří, že příroda je nejmocnější silou na světě a lidé by jí měli sloužit, ne ji ovládat. V poslední době na ni ale doléhá tichý smutek. Cítí, že se jí manžel vzdaluje, a nechápe proč. Aby na to nemusela myslet, vrhá se ještě víc do práce — což nám vyhovuje!"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_05_LIFECYCLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_05_LIFECYCLE"
msgid "Active during 04:00-00:00"
msgstr "Aktivní v době 04:00-00:00"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_05_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_05_NAME"
msgid "Regina Harper"
msgstr "Regina Harper"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_05_OCCUPATION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_05_OCCUPATION"
msgid "Environmental conservationist"
msgstr "Ochránkyně přírody"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_05_STRENGTH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_05_STRENGTH"
msgid "Deep knowledge, shamelessness"
msgstr "Rozsáhlé znalosti a neostýchavost"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_05_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_05_TRIVIA01"
msgid ""
"Organizes annual pageants Miss New Laurentia, starring the \"prettiest\" "
"animals from the reserve. Somehow, moose always end up winning... Rumor has "
"it it‘s rigged."
msgstr ""
"Regina pořádá každoroční soutěž Miss New Laurentia, v níž se představuje "
"„nejkrásnější“ zvěř z rezervace. Z nějakého důvodu vždy vyhrávají losi… Říká"
" se, že výsledky jsou předem domluvené."

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_05_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_05_TRIVIA02"
msgid ""
"Regina published her own cookbook named \"Make It From Scratch! + Edible "
"Flowers Collection.\" The cookbook became a hit thanks to its cocktail "
"recipes."
msgstr ""
"Regina vydala svou vlastní kuchařku s názvem \"Make It From Scratch! + "
"Edible Flowers Collection.\" Kuchařka se stala hitem díky svým receptům na "
"koktejly."

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_05_WEAKNESS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_05_WEAKNESS"
msgid "Her husband"
msgstr "Její manžel"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_06_BEHAVIOR
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_06_BEHAVIOR"
msgid "Probably hates his job, but WHY won't he quit?"
msgstr "Pravděpodobně nenávidí svou práci, ale PROČ nechce odejít?"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP01_06_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP01_06_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Angel is a rep for several reserves in the Pacific Northwest. He's been "
"doing this for 12 years now. He is also the second-oldest son in the Hearth "
"family and the fourth in the Hearth & Hunt family."
msgstr ""
"Angel zastupuje několik rezervací na severozápadním pobřeží Severní Ameriky."
" Dělá to už 12 let. Je také druhým nejstarším synem v rodině Hearth a "
"čtvrtým nejstarším v rodině Hearth & Hunt."

