msgid "Co-owner of Panorama Inc."
msgstr "Spolumajitel společnosti Panorama Inc."

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_01_STRENGTH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_01_STRENGTH"
msgid "Hunting skills, stamina, athleticism"
msgstr "Lovecké dovednosti, vytrvalost, fyzická zdatnost"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_01_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_01_TRIVIA01"
msgid ""
"Have you heard about Malachi's daughter Hailey? No? That's impossible, he "
"talks about her all the time."
msgstr ""
"Slyšeli jste o Malachiho dceři Hailey? Ne? To není možné, vždyť o ní mluví "
"pořád."

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_01_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_01_TRIVIA02"
msgid ""
"Malachi once made a fan page for Hailey. He only deleted it because she "
"discovered it and was scared that she had a stalker."
msgstr ""
"Malachi kdysi založil fanouškovskou stránku o Hailey. Smazal ji až poté, co "
"ji Hailey objevila a vyděsila se, že má pronásledovatele."

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_01_TRIVIA04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_01_TRIVIA04"
msgid ""
"Malachi plans to visit Patrick for the first time in New Laurentia this year"
" for his birthday. He already bought gifts, a professional lighting setup "
"and a selfie stick!"
msgstr ""
"Malachi plánuje letos poprvé navštívit Patricka v New Laurentia u "
"příležitosti jeho narozenin. Dárky už koupil: profesionální osvětlovací "
"soupravu a selfie tyč!"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_01_WEAKNESS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_01_WEAKNESS"
msgid "Writing polite e-mails"
msgstr "Psaní zdvořilých e-mailů"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_02_BEHAVIOR
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_02_BEHAVIOR"
msgid "Loud, may alert animals in the vicinity"
msgstr "Hlučný; může upozornit okolní zvěř na svou přítomnost"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_02_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_02_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Damian is a trickster shooter and a self-proclaimed master of the bow, possibly the best, if you ask him. He’s loud, a bit narcissistic, and flat-out refuses to admit failure, so dealing with him may be a bit difficult.\n"
"\n"
"We hired him to deliver a lecture on advanced bow shooting for our clients. But there was a catch: Damian isn’t exactly teacher material. His thoughts tend to scatter, he bounces from topic to topic with wild energy. He only manages to channel it when he’s got a bow in his hands and a target in sight."
msgstr ""
"Damian je trikový střelec a samozvaný mistr lukostřelby, podle vlastních slov možná nejlepší ze všech. Je hlučný, trochu narcistický a odmítá přiznat neúspěch, takže spolupráce s ním nebývá snadná.\n"
"\n"
"Najali jsme ho, aby naše klienty učil pokročilé střelbě z luku. Jenže Damian není zrovna rozený učitel. Myšlenky mu utíkají všemi směry a s divokou energií přeskakuje od tématu k tématu. Soustředit se dokáže, až když drží luk a před sebou vidí terč."

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_02_LIFECYCLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
