msgstr "Nejlepší lukostřelec široko daleko"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_02_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_02_TRIVIA01"
msgid ""
"Damian has surprisingly good wood-crafting skills and sometimes makes wooden"
" figures for his friends. But he hides this skill because he doesn’t "
"consider it \"cool\" enough."
msgstr ""
"Damian je překvapivě zručný v práci se dřevem a občas přátelům vyřezává "
"figurky. Svůj talent ale tají, protože mu nepřipadá dost „cool“."

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_02_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_02_TRIVIA02"
msgid "Damian has never played a video game in his life."
msgstr "Damian v životě nehrál videohru."

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_02_WEAKNESS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_02_WEAKNESS"
msgid "His ego"
msgstr "Jeho ego"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_05_BEHAVIOR
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_05_BEHAVIOR"
msgid "Dangerous, hard to approach"
msgstr "Nebezpečná, těžko se k ní přiblížit"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_05_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_05_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Naomi used to be a part of Hearth & Hunt, but she recently left us for undisclosed reasons. She's a wonderful hunter with skills and experience like no one else, so we need to get her back.\n"
"\n"
"Naomi grew up in Kilimaya Reserve. She used to hunt with her father and his business clients. Her father owns a tea brand and grows most of his products in Kilimaya. They travelled across the globe and joined Hearth & Hunt when she was a child.\n"
"\n"
"Naomi is sharp-minded and well-educated. She gravitates toward intellectuals, especially her closest friend Pandora Hearth."
msgstr ""
"Naomi dříve pracovala pro Hearth & Hunt, nedávno nás však z neznámých důvodů opustila. Je výjimečnou lovkyní s jedinečnými zkušenostmi, a proto ji chceme získat zpět.\n"
"\n"
"Vyrostla v Kilimaya Reserve, kde lovila se svým otcem a jeho obchodními klienty. Otec vlastní značku čaje a většinu surovin pěstuje právě v Kilimayi. Společně procestovali svět a k Hearth & Hunt se připojili, když byla Naomi ještě dítě.\n"
"\n"
"Je bystrá a vzdělaná. Vyhledává společnost intelektuálů, zvlášť své nejbližší přítelkyně Pandory Hearth."

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_05_LIFECYCLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_05_LIFECYCLE"
msgid "Active during 17:00-02:00"
msgstr "Aktivní od 17:00 do 02:00"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_05_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_05_NAME"
msgid "Naomi Vess"
msgstr "Naomi Vess"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_05_OCCUPATION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_05_OCCUPATION"
msgid "Dangerous game hunter"
msgstr "Lovkyně nebezpečné zvěře"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_05_STRENGTH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_05_STRENGTH"
msgid "Determination, shooting and butchering skills"
msgstr "Odhodlání, přesná střelba a zpracování zvěřiny"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_05_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_05_TRIVIA01"
msgid ""
"Naomi never drinks alcohol, always preferring a fresh cup of tea. She has "
"quite the expertise, so if you’re offered some—always take it."
msgstr ""
"Naomi nepije alkohol; vždy dá přednost čerstvě připravenému čaji. Čaji "
"rozumí, takže pokud vám ho nabídne, rozhodně neodmítejte."

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_05_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_05_TRIVIA02"
msgid "Naomi owns 5 dogs, 2 cats, 2 tortoises, 25 chickens and 1 parrot."
msgstr ""
"Naomi má pět psů, dvě kočky, dvě suchozemské želvy, 25 slepic a jednoho "
"papouška."

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_05_WEAKNESS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_05_WEAKNESS"
msgid "???"
msgstr "???"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_06_BEHAVIOR
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_06_BEHAVIOR"
msgid "Stealthy, she may stand behind you and you wouldn't know about it"
msgstr "Nenápadná; může stát přímo za vámi, aniž si jí všimnete"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_06_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_06_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"The only adopted child of Genevieve Hearth. The rumor is that she was given "
"Kilimaya Reserve as some sort of sick joke. But it was Pandora who asked "
"specifically to be in charge of Kilimaya Reserve, even though her mother "
"didn't allow it at first because of Pandora's skin condition. She may seem "
"like an airhead, but she is standing firmly on the ground, always with a "
"plan."
msgstr ""
"Pandora je jediné adoptované dítě Genevieve Hearth. Koluje pověst, že "
"Kilimaya Reserve dostala na starost jako krutý žert. Ve skutečnosti o to "
"sama požádala, přestože jí to matka kvůli jejímu onemocnění kůže zpočátku "
"nechtěla dovolit. Může působit roztržitě, ale stojí nohama pevně na zemi a "
"vždy má plán."

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_06_LIFECYCLE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_06_LIFECYCLE"
msgid ""
"She is a morning person who had to switch to night shifts due to her skin "
"condition."
msgstr ""
"Je od přírody ranní ptáče, ale kvůli onemocnění kůže musela přejít na noční "
"směny."

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_06_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_06_NAME"
msgid "Pandora Hearth"
msgstr "Pandora Hearth"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_06_OCCUPATION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_06_OCCUPATION"
msgid "Hearth & Hunt coordinator in charge of Kilimaya Reserve"
msgstr "Koordinátorka Hearth & Hunt pro Kilimaya Reserve"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_06_STRENGTH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_06_STRENGTH"
msgid "Manipulation techniques"
msgstr "Manipulační techniky"

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_06_TRIVIA01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_06_TRIVIA01"
msgid "Pandora is a staring competition winner who remains unchallenged."
msgstr "Pandora nezná porážku v soutěžích upřených pohledů."

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_06_TRIVIA02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_06_TRIVIA02"
msgid "Pandora is the second youngest child in the Hearth & Hunt family."
msgstr "Pandora je druhé nejmladší dítě v rodině Hearth & Hunt."

#. Key:	KEY_NPCMAP02_06_WEAKNESS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
#: /Game/BASE/Characters/_Shared/ST_NPCs.ST_NPCs
msgctxt "ST_NPCs,KEY_NPCMAP02_06_WEAKNESS"
msgid ""
"Albinism, has to cover up her skin non-stop due to the climate in Kilimaya "
"Reserve"
msgstr ""
"Albinismus; kvůli klimatu v Kilimaya Reserve si musí neustále chránit kůži"

