#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "map01 reserve cutscene text, part01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"The Rocky Mountains is one of the most iconic hunting regions not only in "
"North America but in the whole world."
msgstr ""
"Skalisté hory jsou jednou z nejznámějších loveckých oblastí nejen v Severní "
"Americe, ale na celém světě."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "map01 reserve cutscene text, part02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"And New Laurentia gives an encompassing taste of this vast mountain range."
msgstr ""
"New Laurentia přitom nabízí průřez rozmanitou krajinou tohoto rozlehlého "
"pohoří."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "map01 reserve cutscene text, part03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"Local foothills, highlands and swamps are home to some of the most sought-"
"after big game in the world, be it mule deer, elk, or moose."
msgstr ""
"V místním podhůří, vysočinách a mokřadech žije vyhledávaná velká zvěř: "
"jelenci ušatí, wapiti i losi."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_DESCRIPTION04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "map01 reserve cutscene text, part04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_DESCRIPTION04"
msgid ""
"There is no shortage of other North American hunting classics, such as "
"grizzly bears, pronghorns, and wild turkeys."
msgstr ""
"Není zde nouze o další severoamerické lovecké klasiky, jako jsou medvědi "
"grizzly, vidlorožci a divocí krocani."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_DESCRIPTION05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "map01 reserve cutscene text, part05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_DESCRIPTION05"
msgid "The further you move upland, the more surprises await."
msgstr "Čím výše vystoupáte, tím více překvapení vás čeká."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPRIVATE01_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map01landprivate01 land cutscene
#. text, part01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPRIVATE01_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"Muskeg is a word of Cree origin that describes wetlands with lots of peat."
msgstr "Muskeg je slovo z jazyka Krí pro rašelinné mokřady."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPRIVATE01_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map01landprivate01 land cutscene
#. text, part02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPRIVATE01_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"They can be as deceptive as quicksand: stable on the outside, mushy on the "
"inside. Ideal for aquatic-loving wildlife, but dangerous for the unwitting "
"visitor."
msgstr ""
"Rašeliniště mohou klamat podobně jako tekutý písek: na povrchu vypadají "
"pevně, ale pod ním jsou podmáčená. Vodomilné zvěři vyhovují, nepozornému "
"návštěvníkovi však hrozí nebezpečí."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPRIVATE01_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map01landprivate01 land cutscene
#. text, part03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPRIVATE01_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"Once you deal with invasive plant species, it will be the best place to hunt"
" for moose and waterfowls."
msgstr ""
"Jakmile se vypořádáte s invazními druhy rostlin, bude to nejlepší místo pro "
"lov losů a vodního ptactva."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPRIVATE01_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "map01landprivate01 land name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPRIVATE01_NAME"
msgid "Thunderbird Muskeg"
msgstr "Thunderbird Muskeg"

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPRIVATE02_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map01landprivate02 land cutscene
#. text, part01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPRIVATE02_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"This shore is consistently occupied by waterfowls, while the riparian "
"corridor along it is ideal for white-tailed deer."
msgstr ""
"Na tomto břehu se pravidelně zdržuje vodní ptactvo. Porost podél vody zase "
"vyhovuje jelencům běloocasým."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPRIVATE02_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map01landprivate02 land cutscene
#. text, part02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPRIVATE02_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"Then there are hills of open prairies, perfect for animals that don't keep a"
" low profile."
msgstr ""
"Dále se zvedají kopce otevřené prérie, které vyhovují zvěři dávající "
"přednost volnému prostoru."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPRIVATE02_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map01landprivate02 land cutscene
#. text, part03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPRIVATE02_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid "These gentle slopes are enjoyed by both pronghorns and bison."
msgstr "Mírné svahy vyhovují vidlorožcům i bizonům."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPRIVATE02_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "map01landprivate02 land name"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "Pronounced SLAH-lah-koom"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPRIVATE02_NAME"
msgid "Slalakum Shore"
msgstr "Slalakum Shore"

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPRIVATE03_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map01landprivate03 land cutscene
#. text, part01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPRIVATE03_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"Only the strongest animals can survive among the highest peaks around Lake "
"Sasquatch."
msgstr ""
"V nejvyšších horách kolem Lake Sasquatch přežijí jen ti nejsilnější jedinci."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPRIVATE03_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map01landprivate03 land cutscene
#. text, part02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPRIVATE03_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"Dall sheep and snowshoe hares, grizzlies and ptarmigans—some of the best "
"game big and small lives here."
msgstr ""
"Žije tu vyhledávaná velká i drobná zvěř: ovce aljašské, zajíci měniví, "
"medvědi grizzly a bělokuři."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPRIVATE03_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map01landprivate03 land cutscene
#. text, part03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPRIVATE03_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"But it will never reach its full potential unless you deal with the water "
"pollution."
msgstr ""
"Oblast však nedosáhne svého plného potenciálu, dokud neodstraníte znečištění"
" vody."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPRIVATE03_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "map01landprivate03 land name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPRIVATE03_NAME"
msgid "Lake Sasquatch"
msgstr "Lake Sasquatch"

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC01_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map01landpublic01 land cutscene
#. text, part01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "Pronounced WEH-tee-koh"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC01_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid "The Wetiko Foothills are New Laurentia at its most diverse."
msgstr ""
"Oblast Wetiko Foothills ukazuje New Laurentia v celé její rozmanitosti."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC01_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map01landpublic01 land cutscene
#. text, part02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC01_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"This transitional space between lower and higher lands attracts Mule deer, "
"White-tailed deer, and even elk."
msgstr ""
"Přechod mezi nížinou a horami láká jelence ušaté, jelence běloocasé, a "
"dokonce i wapiti."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC01_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map01landpublic01 land cutscene
#. text, part03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC01_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"Thanks to the abundance of fresh water and open woodland spaces, it also "
"draws many mallards and wild turkeys."
msgstr ""
"Dostatek sladké vody a otevřené lesní porosty lákají také kachny divoké a "
"divoké krocany."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC01_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "map01landpublic01 land name"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "Pronounced WEH-tee-koh"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC01_NAME"
msgid "Wetiko Foothills"
msgstr "Wetiko Foothills"

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC02_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map01landpublic02 land cutscene
#. text, part01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC02_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"The local swamps, full of woody peat and organic material, provide a key "
"habitat for moose."
msgstr ""
"Zdejší bažiny plné dřevité rašeliny a organického materiálu poskytují losům "
"klíčový životní prostor."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC02_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map01landpublic02 land cutscene
#. text, part02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC02_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"Few places in New Laurentia are free from invasive wild boars, and there are"
" lots of waterfowls and landfowls here."
msgstr ""
"V New Laurentia je jen málo míst bez invazních prasat divokých. Zde navíc "
"žije mnoho vodního i hrabavého ptactva."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC02_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map01landpublic02 land cutscene
#. text, part03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC02_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"Given so much water, it is no surprise that white-tailed deer choose to "
"inhabit these swamps as well."
msgstr "Dostatek vody do zdejších bažin přitahuje také jelence běloocasé."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC02_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "map01landpublic02 land name"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "Pronounced MISH-ih-PEH-shoo"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC02_NAME"
msgid "Mishipeshu Swamp"
msgstr "Mishipeshu Swamp"

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC03_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map01landpublic03 land cutscene
#. text, part01\ndeleted name of the place from the subtitles"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC03_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"If there are flatlands to explore in New Laurentia, you'll find them here."
msgstr "Rovinatou krajinu New Laurentia najdete právě tady."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC03_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map01landpublic03 land cutscene
#. text, part02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC03_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"These highlands are frequented by bison, bears, wolves, even ptarmigans."
msgstr ""
"Na zdejší náhorní plošinu přicházejí bizoni, medvědi, vlci a dokonce i "
"bělokuři."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC03_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map01landpublic03 land cutscene
#. text, part03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC03_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"Don't get too distracted by the unique rock formations and breathtaking "
"views. Use them to your advantage instead."
msgstr ""
"Nenechte se příliš rozptýlit jedinečnými skalními útvary a úchvatnými "
"výhledy. Místo toho je využijte ve svůj prospěch."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC03_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "map01landpublic03 land name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC03_NAME"
msgid "Kermode Plateau"
msgstr "Kermode Plateau"

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC04_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map01landpublic04 land cutscene
#. text, part01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC04_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"Cordillera is home to iconic species such as grizzly bears and Dall sheep."
msgstr ""
"Cordillera je domovem ikonických druhů, jako jsou medvědi grizzly a ovce "
"aljašské."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC04_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map01landpublic04 land cutscene
#. text, part02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC04_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"They're the reason hunters are willing to navigate the challenging alpine "
"meadows and rocky slopes."
msgstr ""
"Právě kvůli nim se lovci vydávají přes náročné horské louky a kamenité "
"svahy."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC04_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map01landpublic04 land cutscene
#. text, part03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC04_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"Visitors may also encounter ptarmigans that nest here and snowshoe hares "
"that hide in grass."
msgstr ""
"Návštěvníci zde mohou zahlédnout hnízdící bělokury a zajíce měnivé ukryté v "
"trávě."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC04_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "map01landpublic04 land name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_LANDPUBLIC04_NAME"
msgid "Jackalope Cordillera"
msgstr "Jackalope Cordillera"

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "map01 name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP01_NAME"
msgid "New Laurentia"
msgstr "New Laurentia"

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "map02 reserve cutscene text, part01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid "Kilimaya Reserve is Southeast Africa at its most diverse."
msgstr ""
"Kilimaya Reserve ukazuje jihovýchodní Afriku v celé její rozmanitosti."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "map02 reserve cutscene text, part02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid "Savannah occupies a lot of space, as you might expect."
msgstr "Velkou část oblasti podle očekávání pokrývá savana."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "map02 reserve cutscene text, part03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"You'll also find patches of lush grasslands, along with a highland forest "
"range to the south."
msgstr ""
"Najdete zde také plochy bujného travnatého porostu a pás horských lesů na "
"jihu."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_DESCRIPTION04
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "map02 reserve cutscene text, part04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_DESCRIPTION04"
msgid ""
"This is one of the most dangerous reserves in the world, as crocodiles, "
"hippos, buffalos, and lions often only pretend to sleep."
msgstr ""
"Jedná se o jednu z nejnebezpečnějších rezervací na světě, protože krokodýli,"
" hroši, buvoli a lvi spánek často jen předstírají."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_DESCRIPTION05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "map02 reserve cutscene text, part05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_DESCRIPTION05"
msgid "But where else would you find all these animals in one place?"
msgstr "Ale kde jinde byste našli všechna tato zvířata na jednom místě?"

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPRIVATE01_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map02landprivate01 land cutscene
#. text, part01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "Pronounced as HYE-felt"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPRIVATE01_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"With water arteries in the north and a huge escarpment to the south, "
"Highveld truly shines."
msgstr ""
"Kinyonga Highveld vyniká vodními toky na severu a mohutným skalním stupněm "
"na jihu."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPRIVATE01_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map02landprivate01 land cutscene
#. text, part02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPRIVATE01_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"The water reservoir in the middle of the escarpment looks almost artificial."
msgstr "Vodní nádrž uprostřed skalního stupně vypadá téměř jako dílo člověka."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPRIVATE01_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map02landprivate01 land cutscene
#. text, part03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPRIVATE01_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"All the animals irresistibly drawn to it know they will be making themselves"
" a tempting target."
msgstr ""
"Zvěř, kterou nádrž neodolatelně přitahuje, ví, že se u ní stává lákavým "
"cílem."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPRIVATE01_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "map02landprivate01 land name"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "Pronounced as HYE-felt"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPRIVATE01_NAME"
msgid "Kinyonga Highveld"
msgstr "Kinyonga Highveld"

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPRIVATE02_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map02landprivate02 land cutscene
#. text, part01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPRIVATE02_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"Right in front of the majestic highland forest slopes, this is a highly-"
"contested area full of shrubs."
msgstr ""
"Přímo pod majestátními svahy horského lesa leží křovinatá oblast, o kterou "
"se svádějí tuhé boje."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPRIVATE02_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map02landprivate02 land cutscene
#. text, part02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPRIVATE02_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid "Kudus and hyenas go up high, wildebeests stay lower."
msgstr "Kuduové a hyeny se drží výše, pakoně níže."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPRIVATE02_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map02landprivate02 land cutscene
#. text, part03\nchanged during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPRIVATE02_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid "Only honey badgers are practically everywhere."
msgstr "Jen medojedi se vyskytují téměř všude."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPRIVATE02_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "map02landprivate02 land name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPRIVATE02_NAME"
msgid "Chikondi Miombo"
msgstr "Chikondi Miombo"

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPRIVATE03_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map02landprivate03 land cutscene
#. text, part01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "Pronounced as FLAY"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPRIVATE03_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"Vlei is a welcome relief from the African heat. Or so it seems at first."
msgstr ""
"Vlei je vítanou úlevou od afrického vedra. Nebo to tak na první pohled "
"vypadá."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPRIVATE03_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map02landprivate03 land cutscene
#. text, part02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPRIVATE03_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"Once you realize crocodiles and hippos might attack you at any moment, it "
"starts to feel less like an oasis."
msgstr ""
"Jakmile si uvědomíte, že vás krokodýli a hroši mohou kdykoli napadnout, "
"začne vám to připadat méně jako oáza."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPRIVATE03_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map02landprivate03 land cutscene
#. text, part03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPRIVATE03_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"Big game knows this as well, so some find more comfort in the arid areas to "
"the north, or the southern forests."
msgstr ""
"Velká zvěř to ví také. Někteří jedinci proto dávají přednost sušším oblastem"
" na severu nebo lesům na jihu."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPRIVATE03_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "map02landprivate03 land name"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "Pronounced as FLAY"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPRIVATE03_NAME"
msgid "Popobawa Vlei"
msgstr "Popobawa Vlei"

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC01_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map02landpublic01 land cutscene
#. text, part01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC01_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"This crucial water resource for Kilimaya Reserve is surrounded by dense "
"pockets of woods and grasslands."
msgstr ""
"Tento klíčový vodní zdroj pro Kilimaya Reserve obklopují ostrůvky hustého "
"lesa a travnaté plochy."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC01_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map02landpublic01 land cutscene
#. text, part02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "Pronounced as LOH-felt"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC01_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"Unsurprisingly, you will not only see birds. Crocodiles and blue wildebeest "
"use the huge water reservoir to their advantage."
msgstr ""
"Není divu, že tu neuvidíte jen ptáky. Krokodýli a pakoni modří využívají "
"obrovskou vodní nádrž ve svůj prospěch."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC01_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map02landpublic01 land cutscene
#. text, part03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC01_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"And your advantage is a higher escarpment to the west, a perfect vantage "
"point for scouting the area."
msgstr ""
"Výhodu vám poskytne vyvýšený skalní stupeň na západě, odkud se dá dobře "
"přehlédnout okolí."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC01_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "map02landpublic01 land name"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes VO" : "Pronounced as LOH-felt"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC01_NAME"
msgid "Impundulu Lowveld"
msgstr "Impundulu Lowveld"

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC02_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map02landpublic02 land cutscene
#. text, part01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC02_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid "Vast and unforgiving, Kaggen Karoo is relentless to its inhabitants."
msgstr "Obrovský a nemilosrdný Kaggen Karoo je ke svým obyvatelům neúprosný."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC02_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map02landpublic02 land cutscene
#. text, part02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC02_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"Ostriches are under constant pressure from their aggressive neighbors in the"
" lusher areas."
msgstr ""
"V bujnějších oblastech jsou pštrosi pod neustálým tlakem svých agresivních "
"sousedů."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC02_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map02landpublic02 land cutscene
#. text, part03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC02_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid "With no place to hide, it's all about vigilance here."
msgstr "Není se tu kam schovat, a tak záleží na ostražitosti."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC02_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "map02landpublic02 land name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC02_NAME"
msgid "Kaggen Karoo"
msgstr "Kaggen Karoo"

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC03_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map02landpublic03 land cutscene
#. text, part01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC03_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid "Mamlambo Heath is a land of great heat and occasional droughts."
msgstr "Mamlambo Heath je země velkých veder a občasných such."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC03_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map02landpublic03 land cutscene
#. text, part02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC03_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"It's difficult to offer it a better description, given the elusive nature of"
" this transitional environment."
msgstr ""
"Tuto přechodovou krajinu lze jen těžko vystihnout přesněji, protože nemá "
"jednoznačný ráz."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC03_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map02landpublic03 land cutscene
#. text, part03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC03_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"One thing is certain though. What won't be picked up by lions, will be "
"picked up by hyenas."
msgstr "Jedno je ale jisté. Co neseberou lvi, to seberou hyeny."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC03_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "map02landpublic03 land name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC03_NAME"
msgid "Mamlambo Heath"
msgstr "Mamlambo Heath"

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC04_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map02landpublic04 land cutscene
#. text, part01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC04_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"When you think of Africa, you think of lowland shrublands, yet Africa is "
"also home to highland forests teeming with unique plants and animals."
msgstr ""
"Když se řekne Afrika, vybaví se vám nížinné křoviny, ale Afrika je také "
"domovem horských lesů, které se hemží jedinečnými rostlinami a zvířaty."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC04_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map02landpublic04 land cutscene
#. text, part02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC04_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"This is where zebras and kudus find it easier to escape predator attention."
msgstr "To je místo, kde zebry a kuduové snáze unikají pozornosti predátorů."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC04_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "map02landpublic04 land cutscene
#. text, part03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC04_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"But these thickets are no resort. Hyenas use this challenging terrain to "
"their advantage, trapping their prey before attacking it."
msgstr ""
"Zdejší houštiny však nejsou bezpečným útočištěm. Hyeny využívají členitý "
"terén k tomu, aby kořist zahnaly do pasti a zaútočily."

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC04_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "map02landpublic04 land name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_LANDPUBLIC04_NAME"
msgid "Tikoloshe Thickets"
msgstr "Tikoloshe Thickets"

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "map02 reserve name"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP02_NAME"
msgid "Kilimaya Reserve"
msgstr "Kilimaya Reserve"

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP03_LANDPRIVATE01_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
msgctxt "ST_Level,KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP03_LANDPRIVATE01_NAME"
msgid "Mirka Valley"
msgstr "Mirka Valley"

#. Key:	KEY_ENVIRONMENT_MAP03_LANDPRIVATE02_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/_Shared/ST_Levels.ST_Levels
