#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO08_1_L02_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO08_1_L02_AITRAINER"
msgid ""
"You’re close enough for the Moose to detect your noise, silhouette, or catch"
" your scent if you’re downwind."
msgstr ""
"Jste už dost blízko, aby vás los mohl uslyšet nebo zahlédnout. Pokud k němu "
"vítr nese váš pach, může vás i navětřit."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO08_1_L03_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO08_1_L03_AITRAINER"
msgid ""
"Move slowly and lower your stance to increase your chances of getting within"
" the shooting distance."
msgstr "Postupujte pomalu a přikrčeně, abyste se dostali na dostřel."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO08_L01_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 2 for beginners part37"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO08_L01_AITRAINER"
msgid ""
"If you choose to taxidermy, the animal can be later placed in dioramas at "
"your Lodge."
msgstr ""
"Pokud si zvolíte preparaci, můžete zvíře později vystavit v diorámatu ve své"
" lovecké chatě."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO09_1_L01_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO09_1_L01_AITRAINER"
msgid "This is the most important lesson of the whole training."
msgstr "To je nejdůležitější lekce celého tréninku."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO09_1_L02_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO09_1_L02_AITRAINER"
msgid ""
"To get to shooting distance of most big game, you must move slowly, keep a "
"low silhouette, use cover, and make sure the wind is blowing from the animal"
" toward you."
msgstr ""
"Abyste se k velké zvěři dostali na dostřel, postupujte pomalu a přikrčeně, "
"využívejte kryt a dbejte, aby vítr foukal od zvěře k vám."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO09_L01_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 2 for beginners
#. part38\nchanged during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO09_L01_AITRAINER"
msgid "Chapter 2 of the training session is now complete!"
msgstr "Kapitola 2 školení je nyní dokončena!"

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO10_1_L01_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO10_1_L01_AITRAINER"
msgid "A moose is a heavier animal than a mule deer or a white-tailed deer."
msgstr "Los je těžší než jelenec ušatý nebo jelenec běloocasý."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO10_1_L02_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO10_1_L02_AITRAINER"
msgid ""
"Use your newly acquired rifle. It has a larger caliber, and its bullets "
"carry more energy."
msgstr ""
"Vezměte si novou pušku. Má větší ráži a její střely mají vyšší energii."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO10_1_L03_1_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO10_1_L03_1_AITRAINER"
msgid "The rifle is set up for long-range shooting, so it’s zeroed at 330 yd."
msgstr "Puška je nastřelená na 330 yd."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO10_1_L03_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO10_1_L03_AITRAINER"
msgid "The rifle is set up for long-range shooting, so it’s zeroed at 300 m."
msgstr "Puška je nastřelená na 300 m."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO10_1_L04_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO10_1_L04_AITRAINER"
msgid ""
"For the best shot, adjust your rifle’s zeroing to match the approximate "
"distance to the target."
msgstr ""
"Pro co nejpřesnější zásah nastavte nástřelnou vzdálenost pušky podle "
"odhadované vzdálenosti cíle."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO11_1_L01_1_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO11_1_L01_1_AITRAINER"
msgid "You’ve closed the distance to 120 meters."
msgstr "Přiblížili jste se na 120 metrů."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO11_1_L01_2_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO11_1_L01_2_AITRAINER"
msgid "You’ve closed the distance to 110 meters."
msgstr "Přiblížili jste se na 110 metrů."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO11_1_L01_3_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO11_1_L01_3_AITRAINER"
msgid "You’ve closed the distance to 100 meters."
msgstr "Přiblížili jste se na 100 metrů."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO11_1_L01_4_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO11_1_L01_4_AITRAINER"
msgid "You’ve closed the distance to 142 yards."
msgstr "Přiblížili jste se na 142 yardů."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO11_1_L01_5_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO11_1_L01_5_AITRAINER"
msgid "You’ve closed the distance to 130 yards."
msgstr "Přiblížili jste se na 130 yardů."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO11_1_L01_6_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO11_1_L01_6_AITRAINER"
msgid "You’ve closed the distance to 120 yards."
msgstr "Přiblížili jste se na 120 yardů."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO11_1_L01_7_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO11_1_L01_7_AITRAINER"
msgid "You’ve closed the distance to 110 yards."
msgstr "Přiblížili jste se na 110 yardů."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO11_1_L01_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO11_1_L01_AITRAINER"
msgid "You’ve closed the distance to 130 meters."
msgstr "Přiblížili jste se na 130 metrů."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO12_1_L01_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO12_1_L01_AITRAINER"
msgid "You’re now close enough to take a clean, ethical shot at the moose."
msgstr "Teď jste dost blízko, abyste losa zasáhli účinně a šetrně."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO13_1_L01_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO13_1_L01_AITRAINER"
msgid "Sometimes, you won’t know the exact location to go during your hunt."
msgstr "Někdy nebudete znát přesné místo, kam jít během lovu."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO13_1_L02_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO13_1_L02_AITRAINER"
msgid ""
"In these cases, you’ll always have a general area highlighted on your "
"Hunting map to guide you."
msgstr "V takovém případě vám lovecká mapa vyznačí přibližnou oblast hledání."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO14_1_L01_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO14_1_L01_AITRAINER"
msgid "Different animals require different approaches."
msgstr "Různá zvířata vyžadují různé přístupy."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO14_1_L02_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO14_1_L02_AITRAINER"
msgid ""
"The general formula is to use your binoculars, move upwind, go slowly, and "
"lower your stance."
msgstr ""
"Obvykle se vyplatí nejprve prohlédnout okolí dalekohledem a pak postupovat "
"pomalu, přikrčeně a proti větru."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO14_1_L03_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO14_1_L03_AITRAINER"
msgid "For the last two, use visual indicators to help yourself."
msgstr "U posledních dvou si pomozte vizuálními indikátory."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO15_1_L01_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO15_1_L01_AITRAINER"
msgid ""
"Well, there goes your shot. Those pesky turkeys are halfway to Kilimaya "
"Reserve."
msgstr ""
"Tak, vaše šance je pryč. Ti otravní krocani už jsou na půli cesty do "
"Kilimaya Reserve."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO16_L01_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION02_VO16_L01_AITRAINER"
msgid ""
"When you're farther away from an objective or the objective area, the "
"objective marker usually appears on the compass."
msgstr ""
"Když jste dále od cíle nebo oblasti cíle, značka cíle se obvykle objeví na "
"kompasu."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_1_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_1_NAME"
msgid "Chapter 2: training meets reality"
msgstr "Kapitola 2: od výcviku k praxi"

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_HELPER_HUNTING_MAP
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 3 for beginners helper01,
#. changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_HELPER_HUNTING_MAP"
msgid "Press <input>{IA_HuntingMap}|displayAs(Input)</> to open Hunting map."
msgstr ""
"Stisknutím <input>{IA_HuntingMap}|displayAs(Input)</> otevřete loveckou "
"mapu."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_HELPER_RECALL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_HELPER_RECALL"
msgid ""
"Press <input>{IA_ActionMenu}|displayAs(Input)</> to open the radial menu and"
" then press <input>{IA_UiActionMenu_next}|displayAs(Input)</> to switch to "
"Dog Commands and select the command \"Recall.\""
msgstr ""
"Stisknutím <input>{IA_ActionMenu}|displayAs(Input)</> otevřete kruhovou "
"nabídku. Pak stiskněte <input>{IA_UiActionMenu_next}|displayAs(Input)</>, "
"přejděte na psí povely a zvolte „Přivolat zpět“."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_HELPER_SEARCH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : " changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_HELPER_SEARCH"
msgid ""
"Press <input>{IA_ActionMenu}|displayAs(Input)</> to open the radial menu, "
"and then press <input>{IA_UiActionMenu_next}|displayAs(Input)</> to switch "
"to Dog Commands and select the command \"Search.\""
msgstr ""
"Stisknutím <input>{IA_ActionMenu}|displayAs(Input)</> otevřete kruhovou "
"nabídku. Pak stiskněte <input>{IA_UiActionMenu_next}|displayAs(Input)</>, "
"přejděte na psí povely a zvolte „Hledej“."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_HELPER_TRACK_BLOOD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 3 for beginners helper04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_HELPER_TRACK_BLOOD"
msgid "Interact with the blood to give the dog the command to \"Track blood.\""
msgstr "Prozkoumejte stopu barvy a dejte psovi povel „Sleduj barvu“."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 3 for beginners
#. part24\nchanged during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_NAME"
msgid "Chapter 2: bloodtracking fundamentals"
msgstr "Kapitola 2: základy dosledu"

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 3 for beginners objective01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE01_NAME"
msgid "Fast travel to the Cabin."
msgstr "Rychle se přesuňte ke srubu."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 3 for beginners objective02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE02_NAME"
msgid "Equip a new rifle and attach a scope to it."
msgstr "Vezměte si novou pušku a nasaďte na ni puškohled."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE03_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE03_NAME"
msgid "Recall your Dog for duty."
msgstr "Přivolejte svého psa zpět."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE04_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE04_NAME"
msgid "Follow the route east to reach the dog training area."
msgstr ""
"Pokračujte po trase na východ, abyste se dostali do prostoru pro výcvik psů."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE05_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 3 for beginners objective05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE05_NAME"
msgid "Find Moose tracks with the help of your Dog."
msgstr "S pomocí psa najděte losí stopy."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE06_1_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE06_1_NAME"
msgid "Reach a vantage point."
msgstr "Vyjděte na vyvýšené stanoviště."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE06_2_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE06_2_NAME"
msgid "Analyze the Moose."
msgstr "Prohlédněte si losa."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE06_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 3 for beginners objective06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE06_NAME"
msgid "Analyze the Moose with your binoculars from the vantage point."
msgstr "Prohlédněte si losa dalekohledem z vyvýšeného místa."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE07_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 3 for beginners objective07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE07_NAME"
msgid "Shoot the Moose to the vital organs (the heart or lungs)."
msgstr "Zasáhněte losa na komoru (srdce nebo plíce)."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE08_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 3 for beginners objective08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE08_NAME"
msgid "Give your dog the command to \"Search\" and find the hit blood."
msgstr "Dejte psovi povel „Hledej“ a najděte barvu na nástřelu."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE09_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 3 for beginners objective09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE09_NAME"
msgid "Give the dog the command to \"Track blood\" and follow him."
msgstr "Dejte psovi povel „Sleduj barvu“ a následujte ho."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE10_NAME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 3 for beginners objective10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE10_NAME"
msgid "Harvest the Moose. Either sell or taxidermy it."
msgstr ""
"Zpracujte uloveného losa. Prodejte úlovek, nebo jej nechte preparovat."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE10_VO09_L01_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 3 for beginners part20"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_OBJECTIVE10_VO09_L01_AITRAINER"
msgid ""
"Congratulations! Your beginner training is now complete. Let’s get you to "
"your brand new Lodge!"
msgstr ""
"Gratulujeme! Základní výcvik máte za sebou. Teď se přesuneme do vaší nové "
"lovecké chaty!"

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO01_L01_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 3 for beginners part01"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO01_L01_AITRAINER"
msgid "You can equip certain attachments to firearms."
msgstr "Na střelné zbraně můžete nasadit různé příslušenství."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO01_L02_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 3 for beginners part02"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO01_L02_AITRAINER"
msgid "Let’s try attaching a scope to this one."
msgstr "Zkusme na ni nasadit puškohled."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO02_L01_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 3 for beginners part03"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO02_L01_AITRAINER"
msgid "Say hello to your new pal."
msgstr "Pozdravte svého nového parťáka."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO03_L01_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes for us" : "changed after 19.2. 2026"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 3 for beginners part04"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO03_L01_AITRAINER"
msgid ""
"Dogs can assist you with various tasks during hunts, but foxhounds are "
"especially valued for their blood-tracking capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Psi při lovu pomáhají s různými úkoly. Foxhoundi vynikají především při "
"dosledu postřelené zvěře."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO03_L02_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 3 for beginners part05"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO03_L02_AITRAINER"
msgid "So, let’s give this a try."
msgstr "Takže, pojďme to zkusit."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO04_L01_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 3 for beginners part06"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO04_L01_AITRAINER"
msgid "Your Dog will now track the nearest animal signs."
msgstr "Váš pes nyní začne sledovat nejbližší pobytové znaky zvěře."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO05_L01_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 3 for beginners part07"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO05_L01_AITRAINER"
msgid ""
"Reward your dog after he successfully follows a command to train him faster."
msgstr "Když pes správně splní povel, odměňte ho. Bude se učit rychleji."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO05_L02_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 3 for beginners part08"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO05_L02_AITRAINER"
msgid "Don’t overdo it, or you’ll spoil him rotten!"
msgstr "Nepřehánějte to, jinak ho rozmazlíte!"

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO06_L01_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 3 for beginners part09"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO06_L01_AITRAINER"
msgid ""
"Your Dog has a focus gauge. It shows how long your dog can concentrate and "
"learn."
msgstr ""
"Ukazatel soustředění psa vám napoví, jak dlouho se ještě dokáže soustředit a"
" učit."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO06_L02_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 3 for beginners part10"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO06_L02_AITRAINER"
msgid ""
"If his focus is depleted, he might stop listening to you and will need some "
"rest."
msgstr ""
"Když se pes přestane soustředit, nemusí vás poslouchat a bude potřebovat "
"odpočinek."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO07_L01_1_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 3 for beginners part12"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO07_L01_1_AITRAINER"
msgid "This is not the vantage point."
msgstr "Tohle není požadované vyvýšené stanoviště."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO07_L01_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO07_L01_AITRAINER"
msgid "Find a vantage point to spot the moose."
msgstr "Najděte vyvýšené místo s výhledem na losa."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO08_L01_1_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO08_L01_1_AITRAINER"
msgid ""
"The Moose is roughly 220 yards away. Set your rifle’s zeroing to 220 yards "
"for an accurate shot."
msgstr ""
"Los je vzdálený přibližně 220 yardů. Pro přesnou ránu nastavte nástřelnou "
"vzdálenost pušky na 220 yardů."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO08_L01_2_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO08_L01_2_AITRAINER"
msgid ""
"The Moose is a fair distance away. For the best shot, adjust your rifle’s "
"zeroing to match the distance."
msgstr ""
"Los je poměrně daleko. Pro přesnou ránu nastavte nástřelnou vzdálenost pušky"
" podle jeho vzdálenosti."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO08_L01_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO08_L01_AITRAINER"
msgid ""
"The Moose is roughly 200 meters away. Set your rifle’s zeroing to 200 meters"
" for an accurate shot."
msgstr ""
"Los je vzdálený přibližně 200 metrů. Pro přesnou ránu nastavte nástřelnou "
"vzdálenost pušky na 200 metrů."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO09_L01_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 3 for beginners part16"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO09_L01_AITRAINER"
msgid ""
"At long range, even a perfectly aimed shot might not be fatal immediately "
"and could cause the animal to flee due to reduced bullet energy."
msgstr ""
"Na velkou vzdálenost má střela méně energie. I přesný zásah proto nemusí "
"losa ihned usmrtit a raněný kus může odběhnout."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO10_L01_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 3 for beginners part17"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO10_L01_AITRAINER"
msgid ""
"To call your dog back, use the radial menu. While he’s away, his focus is "
"recovering."
msgstr ""
"Psa přivoláte kruhovou nabídkou. Když není s vámi, obnovuje se jeho "
"soustředění."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO10_L02_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO10_L02_AITRAINER"
msgid ""
"The dog is a very powerful tool in your hunting repertoire, but he is not "
"limitless."
msgstr "Pes je při lovu skvělý pomocník, ale má své meze."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO10_L03_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO10_L03_AITRAINER"
msgid ""
"He will not proactively search for animals suitable for the current mission."
msgstr "Sám od sebe nezačne vyhledávat zvěř potřebnou pro aktuální úkol."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO10_L04_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO10_L04_AITRAINER"
msgid "He only helps you find animal signs around you."
msgstr "Pomáhá vám jen hledat pobytové znaky zvěře v okolí."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO11_L01_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 3 for beginners part18"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO11_L01_AITRAINER"
msgid ""
"Congratulations! You’ve completed the beginner training and passed it with "
"flying colors."
msgstr ""
"Gratulujeme! Dokončili jste výcvik pro začátečníky a zvládli jste jej na "
"výbornou."

#. Key:	KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO11_L02_AITRAINER
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Tutorial 3 for beginners part19"
#: /Game/BASE/Maps/Tutorial01/ST_Tutorials.ST_Tutorials
msgctxt "ST_Tutorial,KEY_TUTORIAL01_MISSION03_VO11_L02_AITRAINER"
msgid "But the real work only begins."
msgstr "Ale skutečná práce teprve začíná."

