#. Key:	KEY_SHOOTING_RANGE_POP_UP_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_GameFlow.ST_GameFlow
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "shooting range popup description"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_GameFlow.ST_GameFlow
msgctxt "ST_GameFlow,KEY_SHOOTING_RANGE_POP_UP_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Here you can test any weapon, attachment or ammunition, even the ones you "
"don't own. Open the Storage to equip them. If you want to keep them outside "
"the range, buy them in the Shop before leaving, or they'll be automatically "
"removed from your Inventory."
msgstr ""
"Zde si můžete vyzkoušet jakoukoli zbraň, příslušenství i střelivo, včetně "
"těch, které nevlastníte. Vyberte si je ve skladu výbavy. Pokud je chcete "
"používat i mimo střelnici, před odchodem je kupte v obchodě. Jinak se z "
"vašeho inventáře automaticky odeberou."

