#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_AUTOMATIC_DATA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "changed during localization batch
#. number 2"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_AUTOMATIC_DATA"
msgid ""
"By default, Way of the Hunter 2 is tracking how you play. This anonymized "
"analytics data helps us to continuously improve the game. You can disable "
"the tracking at any time in the Game Settings."
msgstr ""
"Ve výchozím nastavení Way of the Hunter 2 sleduje, jak hrajete. Tato "
"anonymizovaná analytická data nám pomáhají neustále zlepšovat hru. Sledování"
" můžete kdykoli zakázat v nastavení hry."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_AUTOMATIC_DATA_OPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_AUTOMATIC_DATA_OPTION"
msgid "Automatic anonymous usage data analytics"
msgstr "Automatický sběr anonymních údajů o hraní"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_AUTOMATIC_DATA_OPTION_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt ""
"ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_AUTOMATIC_DATA_OPTION_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Allows the game to anonymously collect gameplay data, such as feature usage "
"and game performance, to improve the game in future updates."
msgstr ""
"Umožňuje hře anonymně shromažďovat herní data, jako je využití funkcí a "
"výkon hry, za účelem vylepšení hry v budoucích aktualizacích."

