#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_CV_EXPERIENCE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Onboarding, composing CV, part05"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_CV_EXPERIENCE"
msgid "Briefly fill out your work experience"
msgstr "Stručně popište své pracovní zkušenosti"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_CV_EXPERIENCE_HYENA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Onboarding, composing CV, part11"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_CV_EXPERIENCE_HYENA"
msgid ""
"Hobby Hunter 2010 — Forever\n"
"\n"
"I hunt because I can, not because I need to.\n"
"\n"
"2010 — Present\n"
"\n"
"Assistant Manager, Heritage Outdoors Store\n"
"\n"
"If you think spot-and-stalk is challenging, imagine dealing with a bunch of teenagers giving you excuses as to why they can’t cover their shifts."
msgstr ""
"Amatérský lovec 2010 – navždy\n"
"\n"
"Lovím, protože můžu, ne protože musím.\n"
"\n"
"2010 – současnost\n"
"\n"
"Zástupce vedoucího, Heritage Outdoors Store\n"
"\n"
"Jestli vám připadá šoulačka náročná, zkuste jednat s partou teenagerů, kteří se pořád vymlouvají, proč nemohou přijít na směnu."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_CV_EXPERIENCE_LYNX
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Onboarding, composing CV, part12"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_CV_EXPERIENCE_LYNX"
msgid ""
"2020 - present\n"
"\n"
"Ranger for national parks, Mountain trail park\n"
"\n"
"created educational programs on local wildlife \n"
"\n"
"assisted in trail maintenance and habitat restoration projects\n"
"\n"
" \n"
"\n"
"2015 - 2020\n"
"\n"
"Shooting range manager\n"
"\n"
"Dealing with customers, great communication skills\n"
"\n"
"Experience with firearms (training every day)"
msgstr ""
"2020 – současnost\n"
"\n"
"Strážce národních parků, Mountain trail park\n"
"\n"
"Tvorba vzdělávacích programů o místní fauně\n"
"\n"
"Pomoc při údržbě stezek a obnově přírodních stanovišť\n"
"\n"
" \n"
"\n"
"2015 – 2020\n"
"\n"
"Správce střelnice\n"
"\n"
"Jednání se zákazníky, výborné komunikační schopnosti\n"
"\n"
"Zkušenosti se střelnými zbraněmi (každodenní trénink)"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_CV_EXPERIENCE_PANDA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Onboarding, composing CV, part10"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_CV_EXPERIENCE_PANDA"
msgid ""
"2020 — present\n"
"\n"
"Way of the Hunter, Video Game Enthusiast \n"
"\n"
"Logged over 1500 hours in the most authentic hunting simulator\n"
"\n"
"Harvested over 300 5-star animals on Ranger difficulty\n"
"\n"
" \n"
"\n"
"2018 — 2020\n"
"\n"
"Pest Control Intern (Volunteer) \n"
"\n"
"Chased raccoons away from trash cans in my neighborhood"
msgstr ""
"2020 – současnost\n"
"\n"
"Way of the Hunter, nadšenec do videoher\n"
"\n"
"Odehráno přes 1 500 hodin v nejvěrohodnějším loveckém simulátoru\n"
"\n"
"Uloveno a zpracováno přes 300 kusů zvěře s pětihvězdičkovou trofejí na obtížnost Ranger\n"
"\n"
" \n"
"\n"
"2018 – 2020\n"
"\n"
"Stážista v oboru hubení škůdců (dobrovolník)\n"
"\n"
"Vyhánění mývalů od odpadkových košů v okolí bydliště"

