msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DEMO_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"This content will be available in the full version. Feel free to keep "
"exploring the demo version of this world."
msgstr ""
"Tento obsah bude k dispozici v plné verzi. Neváhejte a pokračujte v "
"prozkoumávání demoverze tohoto světa."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DEMO_HEADLINE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
