#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DEMO_MESSAGE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DEMO_MESSAGE"
msgid ""
"Welcome to the demo version of Way of the Hunter 2!\n"
"This is an early game version, so the content is subject to change and you may encounter some issues.\n"
"Please make sure your graphics card drivers are up to date.\n"
"Thank you for playing and helping us improve the game!"
msgstr ""
"Vítejte v demo verzi Way of the Hunter 2!\n"
"Toto je raná verze hry, takže obsah se může změnit a můžete narazit na nějaké problémy.\n"
"Ujistěte se, že jsou ovladače grafické karty aktuální.\n"
"Děkujeme, že hrajete a pomáháte nám zlepšovat hru!"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DEMO_WELCOME
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DEMO_WELCOME"
msgid "Welcome!"
msgstr "Vítejte!"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTY_EASY
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Onboarding difficulty quiz, part09"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTY_EASY"
msgid "Easy"
msgstr "Lehká"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTY_EASY_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTY_EASY_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"For relaxed, beginner-friendly hunts that let you enjoy the wilderness. "
"Animals are less cautious and don't flee far away, their Tracks are easier "
"to spot."
msgstr ""
"Klidný lov pro začátečníky, při němž si užijete pobyt v přírodě. Zvěř je "
"méně ostražitá, neutíká tak daleko a její stopy snáz objevíte."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTY_EASY_DETAILS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTY_EASY_DETAILS"
msgid ""
"— Animals are less skittish and don't run far away\n"
"— Animals visit the same Spots more reliably\n"
"— You can mark animals to highlight them in the environment\n"
"— Your dog companion has better focus"
msgstr ""
"— Zvěř je méně plachá a neutíká daleko\n"
"— Na obvyklá místa se vrací spolehlivěji\n"
"— Zvěř můžete označit a zvýraznit v terénu\n"
"— Pes se lépe soustředí"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTY_HARD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Onboarding difficulty quiz, part11"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTY_HARD"
msgid "Hard"
msgstr "Těžká"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTY_HARD_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTY_HARD_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"For seasoned hunters who want to fully challenge their skill, patience and "
"precision. Animals are highly wary, Tracks are subtle, mistakes are more "
"costly."
msgstr ""
"Pro zkušené lovce, kteří chtějí naplno prověřit své dovednosti, trpělivost a"
" přesnost. Zvěř je velmi ostražitá, stopy jsou nenápadné a chyby vás vyjdou "
"dráž."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTY_HARD_DETAILS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTY_HARD_DETAILS"
msgid ""
"— Animals are more skittish and run further away\n"
"— Animals visit the same Spots with less reliability\n"
"— Animals follow their daily routines with less precision in time\n"
"— Blood Tracks appear farther apart"
msgstr ""
"— Zvěř je plachější a utíká dál\n"
"— Na obvyklá místa se vrací méně pravidelně\n"
"— Její denní režim má větší časové odchylky\n"
"— Stopy barvy jsou dál od sebe"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTY_NORMAL
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Onboarding difficulty quiz, part10"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTY_NORMAL"
msgid "Normal"
msgstr "Střední"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTY_NORMAL_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTY_NORMAL_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"For balanced and authentic hunts that give you an authentic experience "
"without excessive challenge. Animals behave naturally: they're wary, but not"
" too much. Tracking requires attention and patience."
msgstr ""
"Vyvážený a věrohodný lov bez přehnané obtížnosti. Zvěř se chová přirozeně a "
"je přiměřeně ostražitá. Stopování vyžaduje pozornost a trpělivost."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTY_NORMAL_DETAILS
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "changed during localization"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTY_NORMAL_DETAILS"
msgid "Standard hunting experience"
msgstr "Standardní průběh lovu"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTYQUIZ_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Onboarding difficulty quiz, part01"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTYQUIZ_1"
msgid ""
"Would you like help choosing the difficulty level? Don't worry, you can "
"always change it later."
msgstr ""
"Chcete pomoci s výběrem úrovně obtížnosti? Nebojte se, kdykoli to můžete "
"později změnit."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTYQUIZ_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Onboarding difficulty quiz, part02"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTYQUIZ_2"
msgid ""
"Do you expect to spot and successfully hunt a lot of animals in a short "
"time?"
msgstr ""
"Očekáváte, že v krátké době spatříte a úspěšně ulovíte spoustu zvířat?"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTYQUIZ_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Onboarding difficulty quiz, part03"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTYQUIZ_3"
msgid "Do you have experience with other hunting games?"
msgstr "Máte zkušenosti s jinými loveckými hrami?"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTYQUIZ_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Onboarding difficulty quiz, part04"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTYQUIZ_4"
msgid "Do you spend a lot of time playing video games?"
msgstr "Trávíte hodně času hraním videoher?"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTYQUIZ_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Onboarding difficulty quiz, part05"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTYQUIZ_5"
msgid "Do you consider yourself to be a patient person?"
msgstr "Považujete se za trpělivého člověka?"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTYQUIZ_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Onboarding difficulty quiz, part06"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTYQUIZ_6"
msgid ""
"Do you know what game you hunt with rifles and what game you hunt with "
"shotguns?"
msgstr "Víte, jakou zvěř lovit kulovnicí a jakou brokovnicí?"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTYQUIZ_7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Onboarding difficulty quiz, part07"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTYQUIZ_7"
msgid "Do you enjoy challenge in video games?"
msgstr "Máte rádi výzvy ve videohrách?"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTYQUIZ_8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Onboarding difficulty quiz, part08"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_DIFFICULTYQUIZ_8"
msgid ""
"Can you handle animals with heightened senses that require an extra-stealthy"
" and careful approach?"
msgstr ""
"Dokážete ulovit zvěř s bystrými smysly, k níž se musíte přibližovat zvlášť "
"tiše a opatrně?"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_EA_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_EA_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"If yes, it is necessary to delete the old shared config file.\n"
"Please visit the Steam Forum for instructions!"
msgstr ""
"Pokud ano, je nutné smazat starý sdílený konfigurační soubor.\n"
"Pokyny najdete na fóru Steam!"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_EA_HEADLINE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_EA_HEADLINE"
msgid "Did you play the demo?"
msgstr "Hráli jste demo?"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_HH_LINK
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_HH_LINK"
msgid "hearthandhunt.org/jobs"
msgstr "hearthandhunt.org/jobs"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_HUNTINGMAPUPDATE_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_HUNTINGMAPUPDATE_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"After you interact with Map boards found in Lodges and Cabins, you'll find "
"new question marks in your Hunting map. They indicate Points of interest in "
"the area, such as Campsites or Parking spots. They're always worth a visit!"
msgstr ""
"Když si prohlédnete mapovou tabuli v lovecké chatě nebo ve srubu, objeví se "
"na lovecké mapě nové otazníky. Označují zajímavá místa v okolí, například "
"tábořiště nebo parkoviště. Vyplatí se je navštívit!"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_HUNTINGMAPUPDATE_HEADLINE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_HUNTINGMAPUPDATE_HEADLINE"
msgid "Hunting map update"
msgstr "Aktualizace lovecké mapy"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_INTRO_MAP01_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Onboarding confirmation message,
#. part01"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_INTRO_MAP01_1"
msgid ""
"Congratulations on joining Hearth & Hunt, you’ve been chosen out of 354 candidates!\n"
"\n"
"We strive to connect hunters all over the world, and you will be the link between us and those who haven’t joined Hearth & Hunt yet."
msgstr ""
"Gratulujeme, že jste se připojili k Hearth & Hunt, byli jste vybráni z 354 kandidátů!\n"
"\n"
"Snažíme se propojovat lovce z celého světa a vy budete spojovacím článkem mezi námi a těmi, kteří se k Hearth & Hunt ještě nepřipojili."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_INTRO_MAP01_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Onboarding confirmation message,
#. part02"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_INTRO_MAP01_2"
msgid ""
"We document your hunting trips, let you regenerate, hone your skills and "
"invite others to connect."
msgstr ""
"Zaznamenáváme vaše lovecké výpravy, pomáháme vám nabrat síly a zdokonalovat "
"dovednosti a zveme další lovce, aby se přidali."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_INTRO_MAP01_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Onboarding confirmation message,
#. part03"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_INTRO_MAP01_3"
msgid "Welcome to your new home."
msgstr "Vítejte ve svém novém domově."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_LABEL_APPLICATION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Onboarding application UI,
#. application, label"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_LABEL_APPLICATION"
msgid "Send application"
msgstr "Odeslat přihlášku"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_LABEL_ONE_MONTH
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Onboarding application UI,
#. timeskip, label"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_LABEL_ONE_MONTH"
msgid "One month later"
msgstr "O měsíc později"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_RECRUITMENT_VO01_L01_NARRATOR
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_RECRUITMENT_VO01_L01_NARRATOR"
msgid "At Hearth & Hunt, we’re building a worldwide hunting community,"
msgstr "V Hearth & Hunt budujeme celosvětovou loveckou komunitu,"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_RECRUITMENT_VO01_L02_NARRATOR
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_RECRUITMENT_VO01_L02_NARRATOR"
msgid "where experience is shared,"
msgstr "kde se sdílejí zkušenosti,"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_RECRUITMENT_VO01_L03_NARRATOR
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_RECRUITMENT_VO01_L03_NARRATOR"
msgid "and respect for nature comes first."
msgstr "a respekt k přírodě je na prvním místě."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_RECRUITMENT_VO01_L04_NARRATOR
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_RECRUITMENT_VO01_L04_NARRATOR"
msgid "Because no one truly hunts alone."
msgstr "Protože nikdo skutečně neloví sám."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_RECRUITMENT_VO01_L05_NARRATOR
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_RECRUITMENT_VO01_L05_NARRATOR"
msgid "Every story begins somewhere."
msgstr "Každý příběh někde začíná."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_RECRUITMENT_VO01_L06_NARRATOR
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_RECRUITMENT_VO01_L06_NARRATOR"
msgid "Ours begins with you."
msgstr "Náš začíná u vás."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_RECRUITMENT_VO01_L07_NARRATOR
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_RECRUITMENT_VO01_L07_NARRATOR"
msgid "Be part of the story."
msgstr "Staňte se součástí příběhu."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_RECRUITMENT_VO01_L08_NARRATOR
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "changed after 19.2.2026 to match
#. the voice"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_RECRUITMENT_VO01_L08_NARRATOR"
msgid "So do a first step and join us by sending your resume."
msgstr "Udělejte tedy první krok a přidejte se k nám zasláním životopisu."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_VICINITY_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_VICINITY_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"This is the Vicinity Menu. It appears in the sidebar Game Menu when you're close to Points of interest such as Lodges or Cabins. Right now, you have access to:\n"
"— the Shop, where you can buy all essentials.\n"
"— the Storage, where you can manage your gear.\n"
"— a Resting spot, where you can sleep for the time to pass.\n"
"— a Parking spot, where you can summon a vehicle.\n"
"These are just shortcuts. You can also interact with objects such as laptops, safes and signs to access the same functionality."
msgstr ""
"Toto je nabídka okolí. Zobrazí se v postranní herní nabídce, když jste poblíž zajímavého místa, například lovecké chaty nebo srubu. Teď máte k dispozici:\n"
"— Obchod, kde nakoupíte potřebné vybavení.\n"
"— Úložiště, kde spravujete svou výbavu.\n"
"— Místo k odpočinku, kde můžete přespat a posunout čas.\n"
"— Parkoviště, kde si můžete přivolat vozidlo.\n"
"Jde o rychlé přístupy. Stejné možnosti najdete také přímo u předmětů, jako jsou notebooky, trezory a informační tabule."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_VICINITY_HEADLINE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
#: /Game/BASE/UI/_Shared/ST_Onboarding.ST_Onboarding
msgctxt "ST_Onboarding,KEY_METAGAME_ONBOARDING_VICINITY_HEADLINE"
msgid "Vicinity menu"
msgstr "Nabídka okolí"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0101_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style spot-and-
#. stalk, part01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0101_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"Spot-and-stalk suits animals that prefer open terrain, such as mule deer."
msgstr ""
"Lov šoulačkou se hodí pro zvěř, která vyhledává otevřený terén, například "
"jelence ušatého."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0101_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style spot-and-
#. stalk, part02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0101_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"Once you have a good view, look through your binoculars to spot animals. "
"Eventually, you'll see them—or at least hear them."
msgstr ""
"Až najdete místo s dobrým výhledem, prohlédněte okolí dalekohledem. Dříve či"
" později zvěř zahlédnete, nebo ji alespoň uslyšíte."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0101_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style spot-and-
#. stalk, part03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0101_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"One common rookie blunder is moving right in. Instead, check the wind "
"direction below your compass, then scan for natural cover and landmarks. Is "
"there a longer but safer approach to the shooting spot?"
msgstr ""
"Častou chybou začátečníků je vydat se za zvěří přímo. Nejprve zkontrolujte "
"směr větru pod kompasem a vyhledejte přirozený kryt a orientační body. "
"Nevede ke střeleckému stanovišti delší, ale bezpečnější cesta?"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0101_DESCRIPTION04
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style spot-and-
#. stalk, part04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0101_DESCRIPTION04"
msgid ""
"If you're unsure how much noise you make and how visible you are, look at "
"the indicators on the bottom-left of your screen. These aren't superprecise,"
" but they give you decent estimates."
msgstr ""
"Pokud nevíte, jaký hluk vydáváte a jak dobře jste vidět, sledujte ukazatele "
"v levém dolním rohu obrazovky. Nejsou úplně přesné, ale poslouží jako "
"vodítko."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0101_DESCRIPTION05
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style spot-and-
#. stalk, part05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0101_DESCRIPTION05"
msgid ""
"Once you approach the shooting spot, the animal may not be positioned well "
"for a clean shot. So it's never a bad idea to have the right caller on you."
msgstr ""
"Až se přiblížíte ke střeleckému stanovišti, zvěř nemusí stát vhodně pro "
"jistý zásah. Proto se vyplatí mít u sebe správnou vábničku."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0101_NAME
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style spot-and-
#. stalk, title"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0101_NAME"
msgid "Spot-and-stalk: technique for big game"
msgstr "Šoulačka: lov velké zvěře"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0102_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style ambushing,
#. part01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0102_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"The smartest bucks are notoriously skittish. Often the only way to get ahead"
" is to predict their route, hide in thick foliage and wait patiently. "
"Rookies find it boring, but it's effective—as long as you remain virtually "
"non-existent."
msgstr ""
"Nejopatrnější samci bývají velmi plaší. Často je nejlépe předvídat jejich "
"trasu, ukrýt se v hustém porostu a trpělivě čekat. Začátečníkům to může "
"připadat nudné, ale je to účinné, pokud o sobě nedáte vědět."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0102_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style ambushing,
#. part02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0102_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"Not enough natural cover? Or you just can't see a damn thing? Blinds and "
"stands are at your service. Open blinds offer better visibility and shooting"
" angles, closed ones provide better cover."
msgstr ""
"Chybí vám přirozený kryt? Nebo nemáte dobrý výhled? Pomůže vám lovecký kryt "
"nebo posed. Otevřený kryt nabízí lepší výhled a úhel střelby, uzavřený zase "
"lépe maskuje."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0102_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style ambushing,
#. part03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0102_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"Even when you plan meticulously, animals will still find ways to avoid you, "
"almost as if they have a sixth sense! So consider using a luring scent when "
"they are passing by."
msgstr ""
"I při pečlivém plánování se vám zvěř může vyhnout, jako by měla šestý smysl."
" Když prochází kolem, zkuste použít pachové lákadlo."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0102_DESCRIPTION04
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style ambushing,
#. part04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0102_DESCRIPTION04"
msgid ""
"After you release a scent, it's carried downwind. It won't last for longer "
"than a minute, so release it again in time. Give it enough tries: the animal"
" will catch it and will start approaching your position."
msgstr ""
"Pachové lákadlo se šíří po větru a vydrží nejvýše minutu. Používejte je "
"proto včas opakovaně, dokud zvěř pach nezachytí a nezačne se k vám "
"přibližovat."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0102_DESCRIPTION05
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style ambushing,
#. part05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0102_DESCRIPTION05"
msgid ""
"At this point, you should conceal yourself in a blind or a stand. Otherwise,"
" the animal may catch your scent. When you're far away from the target, call"
" it with a caller first and only release the scent once the animal is closer"
" to get it just where you want it."
msgstr ""
"Teď se ukryjte v loveckém krytu nebo na posedu, jinak vás může zvěř ucítit. "
"Pokud je cíl daleko, přilákejte jej nejprve vábničkou. Pachové lákadlo "
"použijte až ve chvíli, kdy se přiblíží, abyste ho navedli na požadované "
"místo."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0102_NAME
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style ambushing,
#. title"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0102_NAME"
msgid "Ambushing: technique for big game"
msgstr "Lov na čekané: technika pro velkou zvěř"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0102_NAME02
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style ambushing,
#. header02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0102_NAME02"
msgid "Blinds and stands"
msgstr "Lovecké kryty a posedy"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0102_NAME03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style ambushing,
#. header03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0102_NAME03"
msgid "Luring scents"
msgstr "Pachová lákadla"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0103_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style still-
#. hunting, part01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0103_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"Still-hunting is especially useful for small animals that love dense cover "
"(but not only for them!)."
msgstr ""
"Pomalé šoulání se hodí zejména při lovu drobné zvěře, která se ráda skrývá v"
" hustém porostu. Využít je ale můžete i jinde."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0103_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style still-
#. hunting, part02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0103_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"The key is to move slowly—VERY slowly—and stop frequently to observe and "
"listen. Eventually, you should spot a hare hiding in thickets without "
"spooking it."
msgstr ""
"Postupujte velmi pomalu a často se zastavujte, abyste se rozhlédli a "
"zaposlouchali. Tak můžete zahlédnout zajíce v houští, aniž ho vyplašíte."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0103_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style still-
#. hunting, part03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0103_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"This is your opening! Once you spot it, your shot window may be very short-"
"lived. Make it clean, but don't waste too much time, or you'll spook your "
"target."
msgstr ""
"Teď máte příležitost! Jakmile zvěř zahlédnete, na výstřel můžete mít jen "
"krátkou chvíli. Miřte na jistý zásah, ale neotálejte, jinak ji vyplašíte."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0103_NAME
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style still-
#. hunting, title"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0103_NAME"
msgid "Still-hunting: technique for small game"
msgstr "Pomalé šoulání za drobnou zvěří"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0104_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style for birds,
#. part01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0104_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"Unlike fully terrestrial game large and small, waterfowl and landfowl birds "
"are hunted with shotguns equipped with shell ammunition. Hunting them is a "
"different art that may require both stalking and ambushing."
msgstr ""
"Na rozdíl od srstnaté zvěře se vodní i ostatní pernatá zvěř loví brokovnicí "
"s brokovými náboji. Při lovu se uplatní šoulání i čekání v krytu."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0104_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style for birds,
#. part02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0104_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"Decoys may appear fake to you, but to birds they're convincing enough. Place"
" them around the area where birds congregate (the more, the merrier!), hide "
"in a nearby blind, then wait for the target to notice one of them and "
"approach it."
msgstr ""
"Vábicí makety vám mohou připadat umělé, ale ptáky dokážou přesvědčit. "
"Rozmístěte je tam, kde se ptáci shromažďují (čím víc, tím lépe), schovejte "
"se v nedalekém krytu a čekejte, až se některý přiblíží."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0104_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style for birds,
#. part03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0104_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"When it happens, the bird may still not be close enough for a good shot, so "
"that's when you call it. Given the right pauses between calls, it'll "
"eventually come close enough. Now, it's time to flush!"
msgstr ""
"Pták i pak může být na jistý zásah příliš daleko. Přilákejte ho blíž pomocí "
"vábničky a mezi jednotlivými hlasy nechte vhodné pauzy. Až bude na dostřel, "
"zvedněte ho do letu."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0104_DESCRIPTION04
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style for birds,
#. part04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0104_DESCRIPTION04"
msgid ""
"Traditionally, hunters take birds on the wing, meaning they flush them into "
"flight before shooting. Some consider this the only ethical way, but most "
"hunters agree that as long as you use the appropriate ammunition and strive "
"for clean shots, you can't go wrong."
msgstr ""
"Pernatá zvěř se tradičně loví v letu: lovec ji nejprve zvedne a teprve pak "
"střílí. Někteří to považují za jediný etický postup. Většina lovců se však "
"shodne, že rozhodující je vhodné střelivo a čistý zásah."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0104_DESCRIPTION05
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style for birds,
#. part05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0104_DESCRIPTION05"
msgid ""
"Waterfowls are erratic and don't really commit to a single area the way "
"landfowls do. They fly around so much that many hunters prefer to just shoot"
" them when they happen to be passing overhead. Again, as long as you go for "
"a clean shot, you're doing good."
msgstr ""
"Vodní ptactvo se nedrží jednoho místa tak jako hrabavá zvěř. Často přelétá, "
"takže ho mnozí lovci loví při přeletu. I tehdy je důležité usilovat o čistý "
"zásah."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0104_NAME
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style for birds,
#. title"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0104_NAME"
msgid "Bird-hunting"
msgstr "Lov pernaté zvěře"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0104_NAME02
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style for birds,
#. header02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0104_NAME02"
msgid "Set up a decoy!"
msgstr "Rozmístěte vábicí makety"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0104_NAME03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style for birds,
#. header03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0104_NAME03"
msgid "Give them a call!"
msgstr "Přilákejte je vábničkou"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0104_NAME04
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style for birds,
#. header04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0104_NAME04"
msgid "Shooting sitting ducks?"
msgstr "Střílet sedící kachny?"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0104_NAME05
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style for birds,
#. header05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0104_NAME05"
msgid "Waterfowls: pass shooting"
msgstr "Vodní ptactvo: lov při přeletu"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0105_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style skills,
#. part01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0105_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"When certain techniques just don't click, activate their Skills. Earn Skill "
"Points used for Skills by harvesting animals and completing Challenges. Each"
" Skill corresponds to a playstyle; you can't activate them all, so pick the "
"ones that will help you with something you're struggling with!"
msgstr ""
"Pokud se vám některá lovecká technika nedaří, pomohou vám příslušné "
"dovednosti. Body dovedností získáte zpracováním úlovků a plněním výzev. "
"Každá dovednost podporuje určitý herní styl. Všechny aktivovat nemůžete, "
"proto vybírejte ty, které vám pomohou nejvíce."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0105_NAME
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on hunting style skills, title"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0105_NAME"
msgid "Activating Skills"
msgstr "Aktivace dovedností"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0201_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on exploring reserves, part01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0201_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"Driving can get you around really quickly. But it also spooks all nearby "
"animals, so only bring your vehicle when you're exploring."
msgstr ""
"Vozidlem se přesunete rychle, ale vyplašíte přitom zvěř v okolí. Používejte "
"ho proto hlavně při průzkumu."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0201_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on exploring reserves, part02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0201_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"As you explore, place tents in the remote locations you expect to revisit. "
"Eventually, you'll have a Map full of accessible travel points!"
msgstr ""
"Při průzkumu rozmisťujte stany na odlehlých místech, kam se chcete vracet. "
"Postupně získáte síť bodů rychlého cestování."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0201_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on exploring reserves, part03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0201_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"When you find something worth revisiting, don't hesitate to leave a Marker. "
"You can place Markers both on your Map and in the environment."
msgstr ""
"Když objevíte místo, kam se chcete vrátit, označte si je. Značku můžete "
"umístit na mapu i přímo v terénu."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0201_DESCRIPTION04
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on exploring reserves, part04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0201_DESCRIPTION04"
msgid ""
"As you explore Reserves, you'll inevitably discover a lot of animal Tracks. "
"When you want to obtain more information, get closer to analyze them. But "
"you only need to walk near them to have them marked on your Map."
msgstr ""
"Při průzkumu rezervací objevíte mnoho pobytových znaků zvěře. Pokud o nich "
"chcete zjistit víc, přistupte k nim a prozkoumejte je. K vyznačení na mapě "
"stačí projít poblíž."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0201_DESCRIPTION05
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on exploring reserves, part05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0201_DESCRIPTION05"
msgid ""
"Be daring, but don't be dumb! Some risks aren't worth taking: you might lose"
" consciousness, and wake up back in your Lodge, potentially far away from "
"wherever you were exploring."
msgstr ""
"Buďte odvážní, ale neriskujte zbytečně. Můžete ztratit vědomí a probrat se "
"až ve své lovecké chatě, daleko od místa, které jste právě prozkoumávali."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0201_NAME
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on exploring reserves, title"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0201_NAME"
msgid "Exploring Reserves"
msgstr "Průzkum rezervací"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0201_NAME01
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on exploring reserves,
#. header01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0201_NAME01"
msgid "Driving them nuts"
msgstr "Hluk motoru plaší zvěř"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0201_NAME03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on exploring reserves,
#. header03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0201_NAME03"
msgid "Leave a mark"
msgstr "Zanechte značku"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0201_NAME04
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on exploring reserves,
#. header04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0201_NAME04"
msgid "Sign o' the times"
msgstr "Stopy na mapě"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0201_NAME05
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on exploring reserves,
#. header05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0201_NAME05"
msgid "Falling out"
msgstr "Pozor na pády"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0202_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on improving habitats, part01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0202_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"Taking care of animals means taking care of their habitat. Animals won't "
"grow up healthy if they drink poor quality water and don't have enough food."
msgstr ""
"Péče o zvěř začíná péčí o její prostředí. Pokud nemá dost potravy a pije "
"znečištěnou vodu, nemůže prospívat."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0202_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on improving habitats, part02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0202_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"See where the animals are living for yourself. Gradually visit stations on "
"public land and private cabins to learn where the landmarks are and open up "
"your Map. Pay special attention to Campsites, as this is where you'll find "
"Mission assignments."
msgstr ""
"Sami zjistěte, kde se zvířata zdržují. Postupně navštěvujte stanoviště na "
"veřejných pozemcích i soukromé sruby. Objevíte orientační body a odkryjete "
"mapu. Zvláštní pozornost věnujte tábořištím, kde najdete zadání úkolů."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0202_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on improving reserves, part03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0202_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"Conditions will never be perfect in the publicly maintained lands. However, "
"they at least adhere to certain standards, while private properties depend "
"on their owner. While some are in decent shape, others are in dire need of "
"proper maintenance."
msgstr ""
"Na veřejných pozemcích sice nebudou podmínky nikdy dokonalé, ale musí "
"splňovat určité standardy. Stav soukromých pozemků závisí na jejich "
"majitelích: některé jsou udržované, jiné potřebují naléhavou péči."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0202_DESCRIPTION04
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on improving reserves, part04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0202_DESCRIPTION04"
msgid ""
"On certain private property, you'll find sources of land and water "
"pollution. These harm every animal that lives in the vicinity. Unless you "
"fix the problem, these animals will never live up to their potential!"
msgstr ""
"Na některých soukromých pozemcích najdete zdroje znečištění půdy a vody. "
"Škodí veškeré zvěři v okolí. Dokud problém nevyřešíte, zvěř zde nedosáhne "
"svého plného potenciálu."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0202_DESCRIPTION05
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on improving reserves, part05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0202_DESCRIPTION05"
msgid ""
"Find every source of pollution, approach and fix it. It might cost a "
"fortune, but animals in the area will grow up fitter than ever!"
msgstr ""
"Najděte všechny zdroje znečištění, přistupte k nim a odstraňte je. Může to "
"být nákladné, ale zvěř v okolí pak bude vyrůstat ve výrazně lepší kondici."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0202_NAME
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on exploring and improving
#. habitats, title"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0202_NAME"
msgid "Improving Reserves"
msgstr "Zlepšování rezervací"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0202_NAME03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on exploring and improving
#. habitats, header03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0202_NAME03"
msgid "Public and private property"
msgstr "Veřejné a soukromé pozemky"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0202_NAME04
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on exploring and improving
#. habitats, header04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0202_NAME04"
msgid "Clean up!"
msgstr "Odstraňte znečištění"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0202_NAME06
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on exploring and improving
#. habitats, header06"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0202_NAME06"
msgid "Habitat enhancements"
msgstr "Úpravy prostředí zvěře"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0301_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on researching animals, part01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0301_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"Don't rely on luck! Unless you hunt prepared, the best animals will outsmart"
" you in the wild."
msgstr ""
"Nespoléhejte na štěstí. Bez přípravy vás nejlepší kusy v terénu přechytračí."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0301_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on researching animals, part02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0301_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"Learn about the animal Species you target in your Encyclopedia. As you "
"analyze animals and their Tracks, you gain more information on each Species."
msgstr ""
"V encyklopedii si přečtěte o druhu zvěře, který chcete lovit. Další "
"informace o něm získáte pozorováním zvěře a prohlížením jejích pobytových "
"znaků."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0301_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on researching animals, part03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0301_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"Identify the biomes animals prefer: certain species may prefer or avoid "
"dense forests, open fields, mountains, and so on. Second, see what their "
"lifestyle is, as some move around a lot while others stay in more or less "
"the same area."
msgstr ""
"Zjistěte, jaká prostředí jednotlivé druhy zvěře vyhledávají a kterým se "
"vyhýbají, ať už jde o husté lesy, otevřené pláně nebo hory. Všímejte si také"
" jejich způsobu života: některé druhy se často přesouvají, jiné zůstávají "
"přibližně ve stejné oblasti."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0301_DESCRIPTION04
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on researching animals, part04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0301_DESCRIPTION04"
msgid ""
"See what strengths and weaknesses the animal species has. Animals usually "
"rely on certain senses and neglect others. For example, animals with a good "
"sense of smell often have poor eyesight. Exploit these weaknesses!"
msgstr ""
"Zjistěte, na které smysly se daný druh nejvíce spoléhá. Zvěř s výborným "
"čichem může například hůře vidět. Přizpůsobte tomu svůj postup."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0301_DESCRIPTION05
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on researching animals, part05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0301_DESCRIPTION05"
msgid ""
"Open your Map and look for where the animal lives. If you aren't sure what "
"the landscape is like, go and check it out in person! While you're at it, "
"scout the best vantage points and well-covered spots. Leave a Marker there "
"so you don't forget."
msgstr ""
"Na mapě vyhledejte výskyt vybraného druhu. Pokud okolní terén neznáte, "
"prozkoumejte ho přímo na místě. Najděte dobrý rozhled a vhodné krytí a místo"
" si označte, abyste ho později snadno našli."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0301_DESCRIPTION06
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on researching animals, part06"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0301_DESCRIPTION06"
msgid ""
"There isn't only a place for everything, but also a time. Your Map shows "
"when animals drink, eat and rest. Their internal clocks are precise, but "
"they still have to travel from one spot to another, so don't expect them to "
"always be on time."
msgstr ""
"Důležité je nejen místo, ale i čas. Mapa ukazuje, kdy se zvěř napájí, "
"přijímá potravu a odpočívá. Mezi jednotlivými místy se však musí přesouvat, "
"takže nedorazí vždy přesně v uvedenou dobu."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0301_DESCRIPTION07
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on researching animals, part07"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0301_DESCRIPTION07"
msgid ""
"Hearth & Hunt's weather forecasts are famously accurate. Check them on your "
"Map so that rain and thunderstorms don't ruin your hunts. If you don't want "
"to wait, consider resting at your Lodge, Cabins or tents—time will pass in a"
" moment."
msgstr ""
"Předpovědi počasí od Hearth & Hunt jsou pověstné svou přesností. Sledujte je"
" na mapě, aby vám déšť nebo bouřka nezhatily lov. Nechcete-li čekat, "
"odpočiňte si v lovecké chatě, ve srubu nebo ve stanu. Čas rychle uběhne."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0301_NAME
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on researching animals, title"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0301_NAME"
msgid "Preparing hunts: animal research"
msgstr "Příprava na lov: poznávání zvěře"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0301_NAME06
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on researching animals,
#. header06"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0301_NAME06"
msgid "Daily routine"
msgstr "Denní režim"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0301_NAME07
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on researching animals,
#. header07"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0301_NAME07"
msgid "Weather forecast"
msgstr "Předpověď počasí"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0302_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on equipment, part01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0302_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"Consider your Backpack before hunting. With a smaller one, you'll make less "
"noise. If you don't have a backpack, you'll be even more silent."
msgstr ""
"Před lovem zvažte, jak velký batoh potřebujete. Menší batoh znamená méně "
"hluku; bez batohu budete nejtišší."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0302_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on equipment, part02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0302_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"At first, you won't have that much Gear to bring on your hunts. As you "
"gradually unlock and buy more Gear at the Shop, make use of all the space in"
" your current Backpack, as additional Gear won't produce more noise as long "
"as your Backpack stays the same."
msgstr ""
"Zpočátku s sebou neponesete mnoho vybavení. S postupným odemykáním a nákupem"
" v obchodě využijte místo ve stávajícím batohu: dokud ho nevyměníte za "
"větší, další výbava vás neprozradí větším hlukem."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0302_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on equipment, part03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0302_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"You'll only get one shot. To learn to get it right, there's no better place "
"than the Shooting range near your Lodge. You can practice on targets with "
"the vital organs marked, indicating where to shoot."
msgstr ""
"Při lovu můžete mít na jistou ránu jen jednu příležitost. Nejlépe si ji "
"nacvičíte na střelnici poblíž lovecké chaty. Na terčích jsou vyznačeny "
"životně důležité orgány, takže uvidíte, kam mířit."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0302_DESCRIPTION04
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on equipment, part04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0302_DESCRIPTION04"
msgid ""
"Before setting off, consider taking on one of the Mission assignments from "
"Campsites. They can get quite challenging, so make sure you equip the "
"appropriate long-range scope, or optics with a night or thermal vision if "
"you plan to hunt outside the conventional hours."
msgstr ""
"Než vyrazíte, můžete přijmout některý z úkolů v tábořištích. Bývají náročné,"
" proto se vybavte vhodným puškohledem pro střelbu na větší vzdálenost. Pokud"
" budete lovit za šera či v noci, vezměte si noktovizní nebo termovizní "
"optiku."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0302_NAME
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on equipment, title"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0302_NAME"
msgid "Preparing hunts: equipment"
msgstr "Příprava na lov: výbava"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0302_NAME01
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on equipment, header01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0302_NAME01"
msgid "Are Backpacks necessary?"
msgstr "Jsou nutné batohy?"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0302_NAME03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on equipment, header03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0302_NAME03"
msgid "Shooting range"
msgstr "Střelnice"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0302_NAME04
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on equipment, header04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0302_NAME04"
msgid "The final touch"
msgstr "Poslední přípravy"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0303_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on attachments, part01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0303_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"Firearms without attachments are like bucks with shed racks. The base is "
"there, but it feels incomplete. In most cases, you at least need a sight, "
"and there are other tools to enhance your hunting and help you properly "
"harvest animals."
msgstr ""
"Střelná zbraň bez příslušenství je jako jelen po shození paroží: základ "
"zůstává, ale něco jí chybí. Většinou potřebujete přinejmenším mířidla. Další"
" vybavení vám usnadní lov a pomůže k šetrnému ulovení zvěře."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0303_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on attachments, part02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0303_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"Picking the right sight is essential. When you shoot from close ranges, pick"
" scopes with low magnification and small lenses. When you prepare for long-"
"range hunting, pick scopes with high magnification and larger lenses. And "
"collimators are great for quickly targeting fast-moving small game and "
"birds."
msgstr ""
"Volba správného mířidla je zásadní. Na krátké vzdálenosti se hodí puškohled "
"s malým zvětšením a menším objektivem. Pro střelbu na velké vzdálenosti "
"zvolte větší zvětšení i objektiv. Kolimátor usnadní rychlé zaměření "
"pohybující se drobné a pernaté zvěře."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0303_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on attachments, part03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0303_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"Night/thermal-vision scopes and clip-ons (attached to the base sight) are "
"essential for hunts in low light. And don't forget about suppressors, as "
"they don't just lower shot noise, they also reduce recoil."
msgstr ""
"Při lovu za slabého světla jsou nezbytné noktovizní nebo termovizní "
"puškohledy či předsádky upevněné před běžný puškohled. Nezapomeňte ani na "
"tlumiče: snižují hluk výstřelu i zpětný ráz."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0303_DESCRIPTION04
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on attachments, part04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0303_DESCRIPTION04"
msgid ""
"Chokes make pellet spreads tighter or wider. As of now, you can buy a tight "
"choke to shoot with a denser pattern even from a longer range. One good "
"example is targeting heads or necks of Wild turkeys. But when you target "
"fast-moving small game and birds, you'd rather use the choke installed on "
"the shotgun by default."
msgstr ""
"Zahrdlení mění rozptyl broků. Užší zahrdlení vytváří hustší obrazec i na "
"delší vzdálenost, což se hodí například při zásahu hlavy či krku krocana "
"divokého. Na rychle se pohybující drobnou nebo pernatou zvěř je naopak "
"vhodnější standardní zahrdlení brokovnice."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0303_DESCRIPTION05
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on attachments, part05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0303_DESCRIPTION05"
msgid ""
"Crossbows and bows also have sights, and crossbows support clip-ons. As with"
" rifle scopes, the concept of focal plane comes into play. With first focal "
"plane, the reticle gets larger as you zoom in, making it ideal for long-"
"range shots. With second focal plane, the reticle size doesn't change with "
"more zoom, making it suitable for closer ranges."
msgstr ""
"Kuše i luky mohou mít mířidla a na kuši lze nasadit také předsádku. U "
"puškohledů záleží na umístění záměrné osnovy v ohniskové rovině. V první "
"ohniskové rovině se osnova při přiblížení zvětšuje spolu s obrazem, což "
"pomáhá při střelbě na větší vzdálenost. Ve druhé ohniskové rovině zůstává "
"její zdánlivá velikost stejná, a proto se hodí spíše na kratší vzdálenost."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0303_NAME
#. SourceLocation:
