msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0304_NAME"
msgid "Preparing hunts: ammunition"
msgstr "Příprava na lov: střelivo"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0304_NAME03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on ammunition, header03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0304_NAME03"
msgid "Changing Ammunition"
msgstr "Výměna střeliva"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0401_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on finding animals, part01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0401_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"At first, it often looks as if there are no animals around. This isn't the "
"case! Animals are there, they just know you're coming, and are actively "
"hiding. So how do you find them? You go out and explore!"
msgstr ""
"Zpočátku se může zdát, že v okolí žádná zvěř není. Je tam, jen o vás ví a "
"drží se v úkrytu. Jak ji tedy najít? Vyrazte do terénu a hledejte."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0401_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on finding animals, part02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0401_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"Look for a high vantage point and scout the area from there with your "
"binoculars. Look carefully, some animals are tough to spot in dense "
"vegetation! If you still can't see them, try looking for animals drinking by"
" larger lakes and rivers, or analyze any Tracks they may have left."
msgstr ""
"Najděte vyvýšené místo a prohlédněte si okolí dalekohledem. Dívejte se "
"pozorně, v hustém porostu lze zvěř snadno přehlédnout. Pokud ji stále "
"nevidíte, zkuste ji hledat u větších jezer a řek, kde se napájí, nebo "
"prozkoumejte stopy, které zanechala."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0401_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on finding animals, part03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0401_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"Just like criminals, animals do their best to hide. But they always commit "
"two fatal mistakes: they leave evidence behind (or as we hunters call them, "
"\"Tracks\"), and they return to the scene of their \"crimes\" (or "
"activities, such as drinking, feeding, and resting)."
msgstr ""
"Zvěř se stejně jako zločinci snaží skrýt. Vždy však udělá dvě zásadní chyby:"
" zanechá důkazy, jimž myslivci říkají stopy, a vrací se na „místo činu“ — "
"tam, kde se napájí, přijímá potravu a odpočívá."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0401_DESCRIPTION04
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on finding animals, part04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0401_DESCRIPTION04"
msgid ""
"If you listen carefully you'll hear audible cues that animals regularly "
"emit. When you analyze the cue, you'll learn which Species it is, the "
"direction where the animal is, and even the approximate distance."
msgstr ""
"Když budete pozorně naslouchat, uslyšíte zvukové projevy zvěře. Jejich "
"prozkoumáním zjistíte druh zvířete, směr, v němž se nachází, i přibližnou "
"vzdálenost."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0401_DESCRIPTION05
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on finding animals, part05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0401_DESCRIPTION05"
msgid ""
"Animals leave footprints and droppings behind. If you spot them while "
"they're still fresh, you can figure out the direction the animal was facing "
"and follow its route: you may eventually get lucky. It's still worth "
"pursuing older Tracks, as they may lead you to permanent ones."
msgstr ""
"Zvěř po sobě zanechává stopy a trus. Podle čerstvých stop poznáte směr "
"jejího pohybu a můžete ji sledovat. I starší stopy stojí za prozkoumání: "
"mohou vás dovést k místům, kam se zvěř pravidelně vrací."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0401_DESCRIPTION06
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on finding animals, part06"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0401_DESCRIPTION06"
msgid ""
"Animal behavior is like clockwork. Animals constantly return to the same "
"Spots to drink, feed, hunt and rest. When you see animals doing one of these"
" activities somewhere, you're likely to see them there the next day as well."
msgstr ""
"Zvěř se drží svých návyků. Na stejná místa se vrací za vodou, potravou, "
"lovem i odpočinkem. Když ji při některé z těchto činností zahlédnete, "
"pravděpodobně ji tam uvidíte i příští den."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0401_DESCRIPTION07
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on finding animals, part07"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0401_DESCRIPTION07"
msgid ""
"Unless you start to spook them. Once it happens, animals may reconsider if "
"they want to go to the same Spot and start to frequent another one. "
"Thankfully, the overall number of Spots is always limited, so eventually "
"animals will cycle through them all and start going to the original one "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Tedy pokud ji nevyplašíte. Pak se může začít vracet na jiné místo. Počet "
"takových míst je však omezený. Jakmile zvěř vystřídá ostatní, časem se vrátí"
" i na původní."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0401_NAME
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on finding animals, title"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0401_NAME"
msgid "Finding animals"
msgstr "Hledání zvěře"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0401_NAME03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on finding animals, header03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0401_NAME03"
msgid "Think like a detective!"
msgstr "Myslete jako detektiv!"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0401_NAME04
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on finding animals, header04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0401_NAME04"
msgid "Auditory Cues"
msgstr "Zvukové projevy zvěře"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0401_NAME05
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on finding animals, header05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0401_NAME05"
msgid "Temporary and permanent Tracks"
msgstr "Dočasné stopy a stálé pobytové znaky"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0402_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on spotting animals, part01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0402_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"Now, finding Tracks isn't easy, especially in dense environments. This is "
"where your dog companion comes in. Just give it the command and pay "
"attention. If you want to look for Tracks without your dog, consult the "
"animal articles in your Encyclopedia."
msgstr ""
"Hledat stopy není snadné, zvlášť v hustém porostu. V tom vám může pomoci "
"pes: dejte mu povel a sledujte jeho chování. Pokud chcete hledat bez psa, "
"přečtěte si o příslušném druhu v encyklopedii."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0402_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on spotting animals, part02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0402_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"You may get lucky, spotting and approaching animals right away, but when you"
" want to target a specific animal, the most reliable method is to arrive at "
"a likely spot in advance, wait for your target to turn up, and then make "
"your move."
msgstr ""
"Někdy máte štěstí a zvěř hned uvidíte. Pokud ale hledáte konkrétní kus, je "
"spolehlivější přijít na vhodné místo předem, počkat na jeho příchod a teprve"
" pak jednat."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0402_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on spotting animals, part03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0402_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"Start by looking for permanent Tracks of animals. When you find them, they "
"are automatically marked on your Map. When animals drink, feed and rest at "
"multiple places, you will see an indication where they are more likely to "
"appear."
msgstr ""
"Začněte hledáním stálých pobytových znaků zvěře. Po nalezení se automaticky "
"označí na mapě. Pokud se zvěř napájí, přijímá potravu nebo odpočívá na více "
"místech, mapa ukáže, kde se objevuje častěji."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0402_DESCRIPTION04
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on spotting animals, part04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0402_DESCRIPTION04"
msgid ""
"Your Map also shows when the animal Species is drinking, feeding, and "
"resting. Just make sure you arrive at the location beforehand so that you "
"have time to hide and don't spook the animals by accident."
msgstr ""
"Mapa také ukazuje, kdy se daný druh napájí, přijímá potravu a odpočívá. "
"Dorazte s předstihem, abyste se stačili ukrýt a zvěř nechtěně nevyplašili."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0402_DESCRIPTION05
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on spotting animals, part05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0402_DESCRIPTION05"
msgid ""
"The toughest part is waiting. Many hunters don't have the patience and "
"falter at this last step. But if you've planned everything correctly, "
"eventually you'll see the animal arrive, and then it's up to you to take "
"your best shot."
msgstr ""
"Nejtěžší je čekat. Mnohým lovcům právě na konci dojde trpělivost. Pokud jste"
" však vše dobře naplánovali, zvěř nakonec přijde. Pak záleží na dobře "
"mířeném výstřelu."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0402_NAME
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on spotting animals, title"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0402_NAME"
msgid "Spotting animals"
msgstr "Vyhlížení zvěře"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0402_NAME03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on spotting animals, header03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0402_NAME03"
msgid "Step 1: learn where it goes"
msgstr "Krok 1: Zjistěte, kudy zvěř chodí"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0402_NAME04
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on spotting animals, header04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0402_NAME04"
msgid "Step 2: arrive in advance"
msgstr "Krok 2: Dorazte s předstihem"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0402_NAME05
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on spotting animals, header05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0402_NAME05"
msgid "Step 3: wait and see"
msgstr "Krok 3: Čekejte a pozorujte"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0501_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on preparing approaching
#. animals, part01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0501_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"When you make an approach, your goal is to get to the shooting spot without "
"spooking the animal. Before the approach, study the terrain with binoculars "
"to confirm where the animal is and figure out the best path to take."
msgstr ""
"Při podcházení se potřebujete dostat na vhodné místo ke střelbě, aniž zvěř "
"vyplašíte. Než vyrazíte, prohlédněte si terén dalekohledem, zjistěte, kde "
"zvěř stojí, a zvolte nejlepší cestu."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0501_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on preparing approaching
#. animals, part02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0501_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"A good path should provide as much foliage cover as possible, follow a "
"different direction from the way the wind is blowing, and be as short as "
"possible to rule out unpredictable complications. However, if the longer "
"path is safer, it's often the better option."
msgstr ""
"Pro podcházení zvolte co nejvíce krytou trasu, která nevede po větru. Měla "
"by být co nejkratší, abyste omezili nepředvídané komplikace. Pokud je však "
"delší trasa bezpečnější, vyplatí se ji zvolit."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0501_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on preparing approaching
#. animals, part03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0501_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"A good destination has the same qualities as a good path, but it should also"
" be an appropriate shooting spot, with a clear view that enables you to "
"execute a clean shot."
msgstr ""
"Vhodné střelecké stanoviště poskytuje podobné krytí jako cesta k němu, ale "
"také volný výhled pro čistý zásah."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0501_DESCRIPTION04
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on preparing approaching
#. animals, part04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0501_DESCRIPTION04"
msgid ""
"Don't be disappointed when you scan a herd and see only young animals with "
"low Fitness levels. Look closer, as the older animals are smarter and may be"
" hiding in thicker bushes. These leaders of the group are usually the ones "
"with the best Fitness levels and Trophies."
msgstr ""
"Nenechte se odradit, když ve stádě zprvu uvidíte jen mladé kusy s nízkou "
"genetickou kvalitou. Starší a zkušenější zvěř se může skrývat v hustém "
"porostu. Právě vůdčí kusy často mívají nejvyšší genetickou kvalitu a "
"nejlepší trofeje."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0501_DESCRIPTION05
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on preparing approaching
#. animals, part05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0501_DESCRIPTION05"
msgid ""
"It's often unwise to approach right away. For example, if the animal is on "
"the move, stalk it until it reaches its destination. That's when you make "
"your approach!"
msgstr ""
"Ne vždy je rozumné vydat se ke zvěři hned. Pokud je na cestě, sledujte ji "
"zpovzdálí, dokud nedorazí na místo. Pak se k ní teprve začněte přibližovat."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0501_DESCRIPTION06
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on preparing approaching
#. animals, part06"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0501_DESCRIPTION06"
msgid ""
"Remember that if you spook at least one animal from its herd, the whole "
"group will be spooked soon after."
msgstr ""
"Pokud vyplašíte jediný kus ze stáda, brzy se vyplaší i zbytek skupiny."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0501_NAME
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on preparing approaching
#. animals, title"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0501_NAME"
msgid "Approaching animals: preparation"
msgstr "Podcházení zvěře: příprava"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0502_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on executing approaching
#. animals, part01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0502_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"Only move slowly or VERY slowly. After all, it only takes one loud noise to "
"spook a whole herd. In addition, take short breaks in the spots with more "
"cover. It's always better to test your patience for an extra minute than "
"undermine the whole approach."
msgstr ""
"Postupujte pomalu, nebo dokonce VELMI pomalu. Jediný hlasitý zvuk může "
"vyplašit celé stádo. V místech s dobrým krytem dělejte krátké přestávky. "
"Raději obětujte minutu navíc, než abyste celé podcházení zmařili."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0502_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on executing approaching
#. animals, part02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0502_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"Another consideration is your stance. When you're prone, you're better "
"hidden, but you also see less of your surroundings. So crouch when you're on"
" the move, and go prone when you take a break."
msgstr ""
"Důležitá je i poloha těla. Vleže vás zvěř hůře uvidí, ale máte menší "
"rozhled. Při pohybu se proto držte v podřepu a při zastávkách si lehněte."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0502_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on executing approaching
#. animals, part03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0502_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"As you're approaching, the animal may suddenly start looking in your "
"direction, seem agitated, or even utter a warning sound. Get into cover, "
"stop moving and wait. If you're lucky, it will eventually calm down, then "
"you can proceed."
msgstr ""
"Při podcházení se zvěř může náhle podívat vaším směrem, zneklidnět nebo "
"vydat varovný hlas. Ukryjte se, přestaňte se hýbat a počkejte. Pokud se "
"uklidní, můžete pokračovat."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0502_DESCRIPTION04
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on executing approaching
#. animals, part04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0502_DESCRIPTION04"
msgid ""
"The visibility indicator suggests how hidden you are. Don't rely solely on "
"it, as even at low visibility, animals can still notice you. If you continue"
" to fail your approaches, dial down the Game Difficulty in the Settings and "
"practice before turning it back up."
msgstr ""
"Ukazatel viditelnosti napoví, jak dobře jste ukrytí. Nespoléhejte však jen "
"na něj: zvěř si vás může všimnout i při nízké viditelnosti. Pokud se vám "
"podcházení opakovaně nedaří, snižte v nastavení obtížnost hry, procvičte se "
"a pak ji zase zvyšte."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0502_DESCRIPTION05
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on executing approaching
#. animals, part05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0502_DESCRIPTION05"
msgid ""
"Some animals may not be spooked but will attack you instead. If you can "
"avoid the attack, it's always better to do so, as it's tough to get a clean "
"shot at a charging animal. Be aware that some predators won't stop pursuing "
"you until either you or they are taken down."
msgstr ""
"Některá zvířata se místo útěku pustí do útoku. Pokud se mu můžete vyhnout, "
"udělejte to — na útočící zvíře se čistý zásah hledá těžko. Někteří predátoři"
" vás navíc nepřestanou pronásledovat, dokud je neskolíte nebo nepřemohou oni"
" vás."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0502_NAME
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on executing approaching
#. animals, title"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0502_NAME"
msgid "Approaching animals: execution"
msgstr "Podcházení zvěře: provedení"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0502_NAME05
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on executing approaching
#. animals, header05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0502_NAME05"
msgid "Charge!"
msgstr "Útok!"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0601_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on aiming and shooting
#. animals, part01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0601_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"The climax of your hunt has come! You're almost ready to draw your weapon "
"and shoot. But before and immediately after that, there's still work to be "
"done."
msgstr ""
"Lov vrcholí. Za chvíli budete připraveni vzít do ruky zbraň a vystřelit. "
"Před výstřelem i těsně po něm je však třeba ještě něco udělat."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0601_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on aiming and shooting
#. animals, part02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0601_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"Before shooting, confirm your target through binoculars. If necessary, mark "
"the animal. It will not only mark the animal itself, but its whole group, on"
" your Map, which will be useful if you botch your shot."
msgstr ""
"Před výstřelem si zvěř důkladně prohlédněte dalekohledem. Podle potřeby "
"označte vybraný kus. Na mapě se tak označí i celá jeho skupina, což se může "
"hodit, pokud výstřel nevyjde."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0601_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on aiming and shooting
#. animals, part03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0601_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"When you draw your weapon and get ready to shoot, use ballistic assists to "
"make sure you don't miss. Also, never shoot without holding your breath!"
msgstr ""
"Při míření využijte balistickou nápovědu. Pomůže vám správně zamířit. Před "
"výstřelem také vždy zadržte dech."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0601_DESCRIPTION04
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on aiming and shooting
#. animals, part04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0601_DESCRIPTION04"
msgid ""
"One of the most important ballistic concepts is the current range (zeroing) "
"of your weapon. As projectiles are subject to gravity, you have to aim "
"higher for long-distance shots. Adjust the range as close to the distance to"
" your target as possible."
msgstr ""
"Důležitá je nastavená nástřelná vzdálenost zbraně. Střela vlivem gravitace "
"klesá, takže na delší vzdálenost musíte mířit výš. Nástřelnou vzdálenost "
"proto nastavte co nejblíže skutečné vzdálenosti cíle."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0601_DESCRIPTION05
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on aiming and shooting
#. animals, part05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0601_DESCRIPTION05"
msgid ""
"Always aim for either the heart or lungs. This way, you ensure both a "
"relatively quick and ethical harvest, as well as higher meat quality. There "
"are exceptions, however, such as hippos. Those are harvested with headshots,"
" and as long as the shot damages the brain, your Hunt Rating won't go down."
msgstr ""
"Miřte na srdce nebo plíce. Zvěř tak ulovíte poměrně rychle a šetrně, s "
"menším poškozením zvěřiny. Výjimkou jsou například hroši: při zásahu mozku "
"střelou do hlavy se hodnocení lovu nesníží."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0601_DESCRIPTION06
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on aiming and shooting
#. animals, part06"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0601_DESCRIPTION06"
msgid ""
"When you botch your shot, animals might not escape but instead attack you, "
"even the ones that wouldn't usually do so. Remember, they're fighting for "
"their lives, so you have to be prepared to do the same!"
msgstr ""
"Nepovedený zásah může zvěř přimět k útoku místo útěku, a to i druhy, které "
"obvykle neútočí. Zvíře bojuje o život; buďte připraveni se bránit."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0601_DESCRIPTION07
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on aiming and shooting
#. animals, part07"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0601_DESCRIPTION07"
msgid ""
"When you place a good shot, you'll notice a significant splash of blood at "
"the location where the animal was shot. Analyze it to see how successful you"
" were. The analysis will help you find out whether the animal will survive "
"or not."
msgstr ""
"Po dobrém zásahu najdete na nástřelu výraznou barvu. Prozkoumejte ji: "
"zjistíte, jak účinný zásah byl a zda zvíře zranění pravděpodobně přežije."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0601_NAME
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on aiming and shooting
#. animals, title"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0601_NAME"
msgid "Aiming and shooting"
msgstr "Míření a střelba"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0601_NAME04
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on aiming and shooting
#. animals, header04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0601_NAME04"
msgid "Go ballistic"
msgstr "Základy balistiky"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0601_NAME06
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on aiming and shooting
#. animals, header06"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0601_NAME06"
msgid "Turns tabled"
msgstr "Když se role obrátí"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0602_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on blood-tracking and
#. harvesting, part01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0602_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"In many cases, the animal won't die on the spot. If you had Ammunition of "
"the correct Tier and shot with enough Energy, indicated by Hunter assist as "
"you shoot, it means that you may not have damaged vital organs enough or at "
"all. and you'll have to track it down. "
msgstr ""
"Zvěř často nezhasne na místě. Pokud jste použili střelivo správné úrovně a "
"střela měla podle lovecké asistence dost energie, zřejmě jste životně "
"důležité orgány poškodili nedostatečně nebo je vůbec nezasáhli. Zraněný kus "
"bude třeba dosledovat."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0602_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on blood-tracking and
#. harvesting, part02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0602_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"Ask your dog companion to do this, or solve this riddle by yourself. It's "
"easier to follow the trail when the initial blood splash is larger. The meat"
" of dead animals will degrade, so the faster you claim your harvest, the "
"more you earn."
msgstr ""
"Při dosledu vám může pomoci pes, ale můžete se po barvě vydat i sami. Čím "
"výraznější je barva na nástřelu, tím snáz se sleduje další stopa. Zvěřina se"
" po úhynu zvířete časem znehodnocuje, proto se vyplatí úlovek zpracovat co "
"nejdříve."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0602_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on blood-tracking and
#. harvesting, part03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0602_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"When you claim your harvest, you'll see a highly detailed overview of your "
"shot, as well as the harvest quality. The overview displays both the amount "
"of damage dealt to each organ (the higher, the better) and the amount of "
"meat lost (the higher, the worse). Don't confuse them! Finally, you can make"
" the call and decide whether you want to sell or taxidermy it."
msgstr ""
"Při zpracování úlovku uvidíte podrobný přehled zásahu i kvality úlovku. "
"Najdete v něm míru poškození jednotlivých orgánů (čím vyšší, tím lépe) a "
"ztrátu zvěřiny (čím vyšší, tím hůře). Tyto údaje si nepleťte. Nakonec se "
"rozhodněte, zda úlovek prodáte, nebo necháte preparovat."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0602_NAME
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on properly harvesting
#. animals, title"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0602_NAME"
msgid "Blood-tracking and harvesting"
msgstr "Dosled po barvě a zpracování úlovku"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0602_NAME02
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on properly harvesting
#. animals, header02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0602_NAME02"
msgid "Call off the wild"
msgstr "Po stopě barvy"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0701_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on culling, part01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0701_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"The higher their Fitness, the larger Trophies animals have. So it's worth "
"investing in wildlife management, habitat recovery and enhancement!"
msgstr ""
"Čím vyšší genetickou kvalitu zvíře má, tím větší trofej může vytvořit. "
"Vyplatí se proto pečovat o zvěř a obnovovat i zlepšovat její životní "
"prostředí."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0701_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on culling, part02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0701_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"Culling means selectively harvesting animals with undesirable "
"characteristics. Animals are culled based on their Fitness, sex, and age. "
"Target younger animals with low Fitness and preferably male. You can also "
"cull female animals, especially the young ones with low Fitness, but it'll "
"have a slightly smaller effect on the population."
msgstr ""
"Průběrný odstřel je cílený lov kusů s nežádoucími vlastnostmi. Při výběru "
"záleží na genetické kvalitě, pohlaví a věku. Zaměřte se hlavně na mladší "
"samce s nízkou genetickou kvalitou. Lovit lze i samice, zejména mladé s "
"nízkou kvalitou, ale vliv na populaci bude o něco menší."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0701_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on culling, part03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0701_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"One year of animal life equals 3 in-game days. Once animals reach the final "
"year of their life span, they disappear, and new animals appear instead. So "
"the final year is when you harvest to get the best Trophy and the least "
"negative impact on the Population."
msgstr ""
"Jeden rok života zvěře odpovídá třem dnům ve hře. Po posledním roce života "
"zvíře zmizí a nahradí ho nové. Lov v posledním roce proto přináší nejlepší "
"trofej při co nejmenším negativním vlivu na populaci."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0701_DESCRIPTION04
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on culling, part04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0701_DESCRIPTION04"
msgid ""
"Note that culling only applies to the Land where the harvested animal lived."
" Animals of the same Species from other Lands won't be affected. So if you "
"manage Moose from Thunderbird Muskeg, it only affects other Moose from the "
"same area."
msgstr ""
"Průběrný odstřel ovlivňuje jen oblast, kde ulovený kus žil. Stejný druh v "
"jiných oblastech se nezmění. Lov losů v Thunderbird Muskeg tedy působí pouze"
" na tamní populaci losů."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0701_DESCRIPTION05
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on culling, part05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0701_DESCRIPTION05"
msgid ""
"When Populations are Vulnerable, you won't see animals with high Fitness in "
"them. Stable Populations are average, while Healthy and Thriving ones "
"reliably produce animals with the best Trophies."
msgstr ""
"Ve zranitelné populaci nenajdete kusy s vysokou genetickou kvalitou. "
"Stabilní populace jsou průměrné; zdravé a prosperující pravidelně přinášejí "
"zvěř s nejlepšími trofejemi."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0701_DESCRIPTION06
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on culling, part06"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0701_DESCRIPTION06"
msgid ""
"To cull the right animals, observe which animals in groups have the lowest "
"Fitness. They're your targets! For species that lead mostly solitary lives, "
"such as Moose, you'll have to scout the whole Land and see which Moose have "
"the lowest Fitness."
msgstr ""
"Při průběrném odstřelu sledujte, kteří jedinci ve skupině mají nejnižší "
"genetickou kvalitu. Právě ti jsou vhodní k lovu. U převážně samotářských "
"druhů, jako je los, je třeba projít celou oblast a vyhledat jedince s "
"nejnižší genetickou kvalitou."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0701_DESCRIPTION07
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on culling, part07"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0701_DESCRIPTION07"
msgid ""
"Improving Populations from Vulnerable to Stable and from Stable to Healthy "
"is slow. Don't worry if you don't see an immediate result. As long as you "
"target the lowest-Fitness animals within the borders of the Land where you "
"hunt, you'll eventually start seeing animals with higher Fitness!"
msgstr ""
"Zlepšit stav populace ze zranitelného na stabilní a ze stabilního na zdravý "
"trvá dlouho. Nečekejte okamžitý výsledek. Pokud v dané oblasti budete lovit "
"kusy s nejnižší genetickou kvalitou, časem se objeví jedinci s vyšší "
"kvalitou."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0701_NAME
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on culling, title"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0701_NAME"
msgid "Wildlife management and culling"
msgstr "Péče o zvěř a průběrný odstřel"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0701_NAME02
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on culling, header02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0701_NAME02"
msgid "What is culling?"
msgstr "Co je průběrný odstřel?"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0701_NAME05
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on culling, header05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0701_NAME05"
msgid "Animal Populations"
msgstr "Populace zvěře"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0702_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on rare furs and trophy
#. potential, part01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0702_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"No matter how large a Trophy is, you can’t call it ultimate if it's just "
"like any other trophy but bigger. The most sought-after Trophies are the "
"ones that are both large and belong to animals with one of the rarer "
"conditions."
msgstr ""
"Samotná velikost trofej ještě nedělá výjimečnou. Nejceněnější jsou velké "
"trofeje získané ze zvířat se vzácnými znaky."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0702_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on rare furs and trophy
#. potential, part02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0702_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"Rare conditions include albinism (white fur, red eyes), leucism (white fur, "
"standard eyes), melanism (black or dark fur) and erythrism (pink or reddish "
"fur). You'll have to get lucky to bag one of these with a huge Trophy!"
msgstr ""
"Mezi vzácné formy zbarvení patří albinismus (bílá srst a červené oči), "
"leucismus (bílá srst a běžná barva očí), melanismus (černá či tmavá srst) a "
"erytrismus (narůžovělá či načervenalá srst). Najít takový kus s velkou "
"trofejí vyžaduje štěstí."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0702_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on rare furs and trophy
#. potential, part03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0702_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"Always be on the lookout for these ultimate Trophies and taxidermy them. "
"They're valuable, sure, but this is how you build a collection that will be "
"the envy of any visiting hunter, a collection to be proud of."
msgstr ""
"Po mimořádných trofejích se vyplatí pátrat a nechat je preparovat. Mají "
"vysokou hodnotu, ale zároveň díky nim vytvoříte sbírku, kterou vám bude "
"závidět každý host z řad lovců."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0702_DESCRIPTION04
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on rare furs and trophy
#. potential, part04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0702_DESCRIPTION04"
msgid ""
"Check all past harvests in your Hunting log. This is where you learn what "
"kind of Trophies each level of animal Fitness brings. Remember that it's "
"always a question of probability. Nothing is certain in nature, except "
"eventual death!"
msgstr ""
"Prohlédněte si dřívější úlovky v loveckém deníku. Uvidíte, jaké trofeje lze "
"čekat při různých úrovních genetické kvality. Vždy však jde o "
"pravděpodobnost: v přírodě není nic jistého kromě smrti."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0702_DESCRIPTION05
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on rare furs and trophy
#. potential, part05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0702_DESCRIPTION05"
msgid ""
"Nothing is certain for every animal, except for the Fitness, as it doesn't "
"change as animals age. High Fitness doesn't guarantee a better-rated Trophy,"
" it only increases the probability that the Rating will increase. So once "
"animals with high potential are close to reaching their life span, see if "
"they now have a better Trophy."
msgstr ""
"Genetická kvalita se s věkem zvířete nemění. Ani vysoká kvalita však "
"nezaručuje lépe hodnocenou trofej, pouze zvyšuje její pravděpodobnost. Když "
"se kus s vysokým potenciálem blíží ke konci života, zkontrolujte, jakou "
"trofej nakonec vytvořil."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0702_NAME
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on rare furs and trophy
#. potential, name"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0702_NAME"
msgid "Rare furs and trophy potential"
msgstr "Vzácná zbarvení a trofejní potenciál"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0702_NAME04
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on rare furs and trophy
#. potential, header04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0702_NAME04"
msgid "It's all in the log"
msgstr "Co prozradí lovecký deník"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0702_NAME05
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on rare furs and trophy
#. potential, header05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0702_NAME05"
msgid "Common misconception"
msgstr "Běžná mylná představa"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0703_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on recovering and enhancing
#. habitats, part01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0703_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"You can only get Thriving Populations in private Lands. This most desirable "
"state requires investment: enhancing habitats with feeders and guzzlers as "
"well as recovering environments from hazards."
msgstr ""
"Prosperující populace vznikají jen na soukromých územích. Vyžadují investice"
" do prostředí: krmná zařízení, napajedla a odstranění ekologických hrozeb."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0703_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on recovering and enhancing
#. habitats, part02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0703_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"And it's just the first half of the equation, as habitat recovery and "
"enhancement only unlock the potential. You'll still need to cull Populations"
" to get them to thrive. But once you do, you can reliably expect animals to "
"appear with the best Trophies."
msgstr ""
"To je ale teprve první část práce. Obnova a zlepšování prostředí pouze "
"vytvářejí předpoklady. Aby populace prosperovala, musíte také provádět "
"průběrný odstřel. Pak se budou pravidelně objevovat kusy s nejlepšími "
"trofejemi."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0703_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on recovering and enhancing
#. habitats, part03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0703_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"When you recover and enhance habitats by getting rid of pollution or "
"building feeders, you slightly improve the current Fitness of affected "
"Populations and also unlock a higher potential that now lets you reach the "
"most desirable Thriving status. The worse the current state is, the greater "
"the immediate improvement, so recover and enhance habitats as early as "
"possible."
msgstr ""
"Odstranění znečištění nebo stavba krmných zařízení mírně zlepší současnou "
"genetickou kvalitu dotčené populace a umožní jí časem dosáhnout "
"prosperujícího stavu. Čím horší je výchozí stav, tím větší je okamžitý "
"přínos. O prostředí zvěře proto pečujte co nejdříve."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0703_NAME
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Guide on recovering and enhancing
#. habitats, name"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE0703_NAME"
msgid "Habitat recovery and enhancement"
msgstr "Obnova a zlepšování prostředí zvěře"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE08_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on the attractants, part01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE08_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"Smart animals conceal themselves in high cover. To force them out, hunters "
"use callers, decoys, and lures."
msgstr ""
"Ostražitá zvěř se ukrývá v hustém porostu. K jejímu přilákání lovci "
"používají vábničky, vábicí makety a pachová lákadla."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE08_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on the attractants, part02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE08_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"Callers imitate animal vocalizations such as mating, warning and territorial"
" calls. Use them when you want to expose a nearby animal or when there isn't"
" much cover, so stalking would expose you."
msgstr ""
"Vábničky napodobují hlasy zvěře, například při páření, varování nebo hájení "
"teritoria. Použijte je, chcete-li vylákat blízkou zvěř z úkrytu nebo když by"
" vás při přibližování prozradil nedostatek krytu."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE08_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on the attractants, part03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE08_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"Get downwind of the animals so they can't catch your scent. Then start "
"calling, but only produce calls sporadically. You can check the optimal "
"timing for each caller in the Encyclopedia."
msgstr ""
"Postavte se tak, aby vítr vál od zvěře směrem k vám. Nezachytí pak váš pach."
" Potom ji vábte s přestávkami. Doporučené intervaly pro jednotlivé vábničky "
"najdete v encyklopedii."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE08_DESCRIPTION04
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on the attractants, part04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE08_DESCRIPTION04"
msgid ""
"Once the animal's curiosity is piqued and it starts to approach slowly, it's"
" on the hook. Just don't start spamming calls, or the animal may find them "
"unnatural and may even be spooked."
msgstr ""
"Jakmile zvěř zbystří a začne se pomalu přibližovat, vábení zabralo. "
"Nepoužívejte však vábničku příliš často: nepřirozené opakování hlasů ji může"
" vyplašit."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE08_DESCRIPTION05
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on the attractants, part05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE08_DESCRIPTION05"
msgid ""
"Decoys create visual anchors for animals. The more you set them up in the "
"area, the more they are likely to work. Place decoys near lakeshores where "
"waterfowls often congregate or in open fields that would force landfowls to "
"expose themselves."
msgstr ""
"Vábicí makety upoutají pozornost zvěře. Čím víc jich rozmístíte, tím spíš "
"zaberou. Umístěte je u břehů jezer, kde se shromažďuje vodní ptactvo, nebo "
"na otevřené plochy, kde hrabavá zvěř vystoupí z krytu."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE08_DESCRIPTION06
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on the attractants, part06"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE08_DESCRIPTION06"
msgid ""
"Make sure you're not too far away from the decoys once you place them. Call "
"your target with a caller so that it can notice the decoy. Remember that "
"decoys will drop down to the ground in time, so you have to go back and "
"manually set them up to use them again."
msgstr ""
"Po rozmístění maket zůstaňte poblíž. Vábničkou přilákejte zvěř, aby si jich "
"všimla. Makety se časem sklopí k zemi; pro další použití je musíte znovu "
"postavit."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE08_DESCRIPTION07
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on the attractants, part07"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE08_DESCRIPTION07"
msgid ""
"Lures contain scents that animals find irresistible. These scents are less "
"reliable than decoys because they are carried by the wind and fade quickly. "
"So either use them on animals that are passing by closely or only after you "
"call the target to the place where you expect the wind to carry the scent."
msgstr ""
"Pachová lákadla šíří pro zvěř přitažlivou vůni. Oproti maketám jsou méně "
"spolehlivá: vítr pach roznáší a lákadlo rychle vyprchá. Použijte je u zvěře "
"procházející nablízku nebo zvěř nejdřív přilákejte tam, kam vítr pach "
"zanese."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE08_DESCRIPTION08
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on the attractants, part08"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE08_DESCRIPTION08"
msgid ""
"Continue to release the scent as you're concealing yourself in a blind or a "
"stand, or the animal may lose interest. Check in the Encyclopedia what kind "
"of lure you're using: the short-duration ones fade in about half a minute, "
"while the long-duration lures last twice as long."
msgstr ""
"Uvolňujte pachové lákadlo, zatímco se skrýváte v loveckém krytu nebo na "
"posedu; jinak může zvěř ztratit zájem. V encyklopedii si ověřte dobu účinku:"
" krátkodobá lákadla vyprchají asi za půl minuty, dlouhodobá vydrží dvakrát "
"déle."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE08_NAME
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on the attractants, title"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE08_NAME"
msgid "Attracting the best animals"
msgstr "Jak přilákat nejlepší kusy"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE08_NAME02
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on the attractants, header02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE08_NAME02"
msgid "Call me maybe"
msgstr "Zvěř na zavolání"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE08_NAME05
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on the attractants, header05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE08_NAME05"
msgid "Bird brains"
msgstr "Vábicí makety pro pernatou zvěř"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE08_NAME07
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on the attractants, header07"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE08_NAME07"
msgid "Irresistible scents"
msgstr "Neodolatelná pachová lákadla"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE09_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on the right firearm, part01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE09_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"It is not just about harvesting animals. It is about ensuring that you "
"harvest them in the best state. What it usually means is you should make the"
" animal drop as fast as possible while making sure as little damage as "
"possible is done."
msgstr ""
"Nestačí zvěř jen ulovit. Důležitý je rychlý a šetrný zásah, při němž se "
"zvěřina poškodí co nejméně."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE09_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on the right firearm, part02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE09_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"Animals are organized into Tiers. Tiers are numbers that communicate how "
"much energy your shots require to get to vital organs. The heavier the "
"animal, the higher the Tier and the more powerful ammunition you need. You "
"can check the Tier of each species and ammunition in the Encyclopedia."
msgstr ""
"Zvěř je rozdělena do úrovní podle energie potřebné k zasažení životně "
"důležitých orgánů. Čím je druh těžší, tím vyšší úroveň má a tím výkonnější "
"střelivo vyžaduje. Úroveň každého druhu i střeliva najdete v encyklopedii."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE09_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on the right firearm, part03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE09_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"Just getting the right Tier is never enough. You should also make sure that "
"you use the appropriate ammunition at the right distance."
msgstr ""
"Samotná správná úroveň střeliva nestačí. Záleží také na druhu střeliva a "
"vzdálenosti střelby."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE09_DESCRIPTION04
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on the right firearm, part04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE09_DESCRIPTION04"
msgid ""
"How can you tell the difference? This is where Hunter assist comes in. When "
"you are aiming for a shot, you will see a visual indication whether the "
"expected energy you will produce is appropriate for the animal. If you’re "
"too close, you may damage the animal too much, so move away, and vice versa."
msgstr ""
"S posouzením pomůže lovecká asistence. Při míření ukáže, zda bude energie "
"střely pro daný kus vhodná. Pokud jste příliš blízko, hrozí nadměrné "
"poškození zvěřiny a je lepší se vzdálit. Pokud jste příliš daleko, přibližte"
" se."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE09_DESCRIPTION05
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on the right firearm, part05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE09_DESCRIPTION05"
msgid ""
"Ethical harvests are effective harvests. The less time the animal suffers, "
"the better meat you get, the better your hunt score. This is why it is "
"always crucial to aim to the vital organs, the heart and both lungs, and "
"ignore everything else."
msgstr ""
"Etický lov znamená účinný zásah. Čím kratší dobu kus trpí, tím kvalitnější "
"je zvěřina a tím lepší je hodnocení lovu. Proto miřte na komoru, kde jsou "
"srdce a plíce."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE09_DESCRIPTION06
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on the right firearm, part06"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE09_DESCRIPTION06"
msgid ""
"You can tell how effective your shot was not only by the time the animal "
"stays alive, but by the amount of blood and blood colors. Lots of red or "
"bright pink blood with bubbles indicates a successful lung shot, meaning you"
" did a good job."
msgstr ""
"Účinek zásahu poznáte nejen podle toho, jak dlouho zvíře ještě žije, ale "
"také podle množství a barvy krve. Větší množství červené nebo světle růžové "
"zpěněné barvy ukazuje na zásah plic."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE09_DESCRIPTION07
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on the right firearm, part07"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE09_DESCRIPTION07"
msgid ""
"Smaller amounts of dark red blood, brownish hues and processed food "
"fragments indicate that you should go to the Shooting range and work on your"
" aiming."
msgstr ""
"Menší množství tmavě červené barvy, hnědavé zbarvení a zbytky natrávené "
"potravy naznačují zásah mimo komoru. Vyplatí se zapracovat na přesnosti na "
"střelnici."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE09_NAME
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on the right firearm, title"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE09_NAME"
msgid "Picking the right firearm"
msgstr "Výběr vhodné střelné zbraně"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE09_NAME05
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on the right firearm, header05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE09_NAME05"
msgid "Ethical is effective"
msgstr "Eticky a účinně"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE10_DESCRIPTION01
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on American foxhound, part 01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE10_DESCRIPTION01"
msgid ""
"The American foxhound is a highly reliable blood-tracking breed. It has a "
"keen sense of smell like no one else!"
msgstr ""
"Americký foxhound je spolehlivý pes pro dosled po barvě. Má mimořádně "
"citlivý čich."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE10_DESCRIPTION02
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on American foxhound, part 02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE10_DESCRIPTION02"
msgid ""
"Every success makes your companion more skillful. For example, when you "
"command the dog to \"Search\" and it finds animal Tracks, its search and "
"quartering aptitude increases. Repeat the success enough times, and the "
"aptitude will level up."
msgstr ""
"Každý úspěch psa posouvá dál. Když mu dáte povel „Hledej“ a najde stopy "
"zvěře, zlepší se ve vyhledávání a slídění. Po dostatečném počtu úspěchů "
"získá další úroveň této dovednosti."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE10_DESCRIPTION03
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on American foxhound, part 03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE10_DESCRIPTION03"
msgid ""
"But foxhounds are all about finding blood. Once it finds a blood splatter, "
"you shouldn't give a new \"Search\" command, as it'll look for other animal "
"Tracks. Instead, ask it to \"Track Blood\" and follow it—if the target is "
"out there, you'll get to it sooner than later!"
msgstr ""
"Foxhound vyniká v dosledu po barvě. Jakmile najde barvu, nedávejte mu znovu "
"povel „Hledej“: začal by vyhledávat stopy jiné zvěře. Dejte mu povel „Sleduj"
" barvu“ a vydejte se za ním. Je-li postřelený kus stále v terénu, pes vás k "
"němu dovede."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE10_DESCRIPTION04
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:	"Notes Localization" : "Guide on American foxhound, part 04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE10_DESCRIPTION04"
msgid ""
"When the foxhound finds the carcass, it won't just wait for you—it'll start "
"baying. Unlike barking you may be used to with other breeds, baying is a "
"sustained, intense howling sound."
msgstr ""
"Když foxhound najde zhaslý kus, začne nález hlasitě hlásit. Jeho hlasový "
"projev je táhlý a výrazný, jiný než běžné štěkání."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE10_DESCRIPTION05
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE10_DESCRIPTION05"
msgid ""
"Occasionally, you'll find your companion \"Released\". At this moment, it "
"doesn't follow any command. There are two explanations. It either doesn't "
"respect you enough yet—just spend more time with it—or it's been signaling "
"you about a Track it found and has given up."
msgstr ""
"Někdy uvidíte u psa stav „Volný“. Znamená to, že právě neplní žádný povel. "
"Buď s vámi ještě nemá dostatečně pevný vztah, nebo vás upozorňoval na "
"nalezené stopy a po čase čekání toho nechal."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_GUIDE10_NAME
