msgid "Baying"
msgstr "Hlášení nálezu vytím"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIP01_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "The first tip Player sees when
#. Map01 is loaded"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIP01_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"New Laurentia is a big place! It may be overwhelming at first, but you'll get to know it like the back of your hand, and grow to love it. Just don't expect to run around and spot animals right away—take it slowly.\n"
"\n"
"Explore the surroundings and follow the Tracks that animals leave behind. Soon enough you'll hear audible cues—that's where your target will be!\n"
"\n"
"Consult the guides in your Encyclopedia or tutorials in the Main Menu to learn where to find and hunt animals properly."
msgstr ""
"New Laurentia je rozlehlá oblast! Zpočátku vás může její velikost zaskočit, ale časem ji poznáte jako své boty a oblíbíte si ji. Nečekejte však, že stačí pobíhat po okolí a hned uvidíte zvěř. Postupujte pomalu.\n"
"\n"
"Prozkoumávejte okolí a sledujte stopy, které zvěř zanechává. Brzy uslyšíte její hlasy a poznáte, kde ji hledat.\n"
"\n"
"V průvodcích v encyklopedii nebo v tutoriálech v hlavní nabídce se dozvíte, kde zvěř hledat a jak ji správně lovit."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIP01_NAME
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "The first tip Player sees when
#. Map01 is loaded, name"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIP01_NAME"
msgid "Things to try first"
msgstr "Jak začít"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING01_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Tip seen on the Loading Screen,
#. environment tip01"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING01_DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Have fun in this game! But do hunt responsibly in real life."
msgstr "Bavte se v této hře! Ale v reálném životě lovte zodpovědně."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING02_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Tip seen on the Loading Screen,
#. environment tip02"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING02_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"There are issues with hunting around the world, but a lot of criticism is in"
" bad faith. It is a product of ignorance of how hunting contributes to "
"conservation."
msgstr ""
"S lovem se po celém světě pojí problémy, ale velká část kritiky je "
"nepoctivá. Pramení z neznalosti toho, jak lov přispívá k ochraně přírody."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING03_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Tip seen on the Loading Screen,
#. environment tip03"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING03_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Hunting is often used to maintain a healthy Population of animals where "
"reserves are too small or where hunting brings positive investment to the "
"area."
msgstr ""
"Lov často pomáhá udržovat zdravé populace zvěře tam, kde jsou rezervace "
"příliš malé nebo kde přináší oblasti prospěšné investice."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING04_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Tip seen on the Loading Screen,
#. environment tip04"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING04_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Populations of many species around the world would go extinct if not for "
"hunters managing them."
msgstr ""
"Populace mnoha druhů po celém světě by vyhynuly, kdyby o ně myslivci "
"nepečovali."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING05_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Tip seen on the Loading Screen,
#. environment tip05"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING05_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Smartly regulated hunting is an effective strategy against poachers as it "
"makes Populations more resilient in the long run."
msgstr ""
"Chytře regulovaný lov je účinnou strategií proti pytlákům, protože díky němu"
" jsou populace z dlouhodobého hlediska odolnější."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING06_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Tip seen on the Loading Screen,
#. environment map01 tip06"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING06_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Across Canada, Indigenous communities are reporting increasingly erratic "
"weather. Winters are becoming shorter and less predictable, springs are "
"arriving earlier, and extreme weather events are more frequent."
msgstr ""
"Po celé Kanadě hlásí domorodé komunity stále nevyzpytatelnější počasí. Zimy "
"jsou kratší a méně předvídatelné, jara přicházejí dříve a extrémní výkyvy "
"počasí jsou častější."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING07_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Tip seen on the Loading Screen,
#. environment map01 tip07"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING07_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"The number of Canadians who hunt close to home is slowly decreasing. It is "
"now 3% of all households."
msgstr ""
"Počet Kanaďanů, kteří loví blízko domova, pomalu klesá. Nyní jsou to 3 % "
"všech domácností."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING08_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Tip seen on the Loading Screen,
#. environment map01 tip08"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING08_DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Canada is home to 28% of the world’s boreal forests."
msgstr "Kanada je domovem 28 % světových boreálních lesů."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING09_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Tip seen on the Loading Screen,
#. environment map01 tip09"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING09_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Deforestation in Canada is among the world’s lowest, with the annual "
"deforestation rate declining steadily over the past 25 years."
msgstr ""
"Odlesňování v Kanadě patří k nejnižším na světě, přičemž roční míra "
"odlesňování za posledních 25 let neustále klesá."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING10_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Tip seen on the Loading Screen,
#. environment map01 tip10"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING10_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Canadian wetlands account for approximately one quarter of the world's total"
" wetlands."
msgstr ""
"Kanadské mokřady tvoří přibližně jednu čtvrtinu všech světových mokřadů."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING11_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Tip seen on the Loading Screen,
#. environment map02 tip11"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING11_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Archaeological evidence shows that hunter-gatherer communities in Southern "
"Africa existed well before the emergence of Homo sapiens."
msgstr ""
"Archeologické důkazy ukazují, že komunity lovců a sběračů v jižní Africe "
"existovaly dlouho před vznikem Homo sapiens."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING12_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Tip seen on the Loading Screen,
#. environment map02 tip12"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING12_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"In the late 2010s, South Africa was the world’s second-most exporter of "
"trophies, after Canada."
msgstr ""
"Na konci desátých let 21. století byla Jižní Afrika po Kanadě druhým "
"největším vývozcem trofejí na světě."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING13_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Tip seen on the Loading Screen,
#. environment map02 tip13"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING13_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Only 25% of wild-sourced trophies in South Africa come through species "
"managed through a national conservation plan."
msgstr ""
"Pouze 25 % trofejí z volně žijící zvěře v Jižní Africe pochází od druhů, na "
"které se vztahuje národní plán ochrany přírody."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING14_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Tip seen on the Loading Screen,
#. environment map02 tip14"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING14_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"There’s hardly any place on the Earth where there would be more variety of "
"game animals as in South Africa."
msgstr ""
"Na Zemi je jen málo míst s větší druhovou rozmanitostí lovné zvěře než Jižní"
" Afrika."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING15_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Tip seen on the Loading Screen,
#. environment map02 tip15"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING15_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"South Africa may produce an impression of “anything goes,” but in fact "
"hunting is thoroughly regulated."
msgstr ""
"Jižní Afrika může působit jako místo, kde je „všechno dovoleno“, ale ve "
"skutečnosti je lov přísně regulován."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING16_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Tip seen on the Loading Screen,
#. joke tip16"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING16_DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Spooking a lot of animals? No driving and running around should help."
msgstr "Plašíte příliš mnoho zvěře? Zkuste se obejít bez vozidla a neběhat."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING17_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Tip seen on the Loading Screen,
#. joke tip17"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING17_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Two hunters are out bear hunting in the woods. They come to a fork in the "
"trail with a sign that says “Bear left.” So they went home."
msgstr ""
"Dva myslivci vyrazili do lesa na medvědy. Na rozcestí našli anglickou ceduli"
" „Bear left“. Místo „Medvěd vlevo“ si přečetli „Medvěd odešel“ — a šli domů."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING18_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Tip seen on the Loading Screen,
#. joke tip18"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING18_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"What’s the difference between beer nuts and deer nuts? Beer nuts are around "
"two dollars, and deer nuts are just under a buck."
msgstr ""
"Jaký je rozdíl mezi pivními oříšky a jeleními „oříšky“? Ty první leží na "
"stole, ty druhé visí pod jelenem."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING19_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Tip seen on the Loading Screen,
#. joke tip19"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING19_DESCRIPTION"
msgid "What side of a Turkey has the most feathers? The outside."
msgstr "Na které straně krocana je nejvíc peří? Na té vnější."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING20_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Tip seen on the Loading Screen,
#. joke tip20"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING20_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Three hunters come across tracks in a forest. One hunter claims they are "
"bear tracks. The second frowns and says they are badger tracks. The third "
"laughs and says they are baby elephant tracks. Then the train hits them."
msgstr ""
"Tři lovci narazí v lese na stopy. Jeden lovec tvrdí, že jde o medvědí stopy."
" Druhý se zamračí a říká, že to jsou jezevčí stopy. Třetí se směje a říká, "
"že jsou to stopy slůněte. Pak je srazí vlak."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING21_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Tip seen on the Loading Screen,
#. joke tip21, reused from WotH1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING21_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Why should you avoid hunting deer with a shotgun? Because if you encounter a"
" deer who has a shotgun, it's best to just leave them alone."
msgstr ""
"Proč se raději vyhnout lovu jelena s brokovnicí? Protože jelena, který má "
"brokovnici, je lepší nechat na pokoji."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING22_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Tip seen on the Loading Screen,
#. joke tip22, reused from WotH1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING22_DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Looking for new hunting gear? Good camouflage is hard to find. :)"
msgstr "Hledáte nové lovecké vybavení? Dobrá kamufláž se hledá těžko. :)"

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING23_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Tip seen on the Loading Screen, fun
#. fact tip23, reused from WotH1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING23_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"The term “Sniper” originally referred to hunters skilled enough to shoot a "
"Snipe, a species of bird."
msgstr ""
"Anglické slovo „sniper“ původně označovalo lovce, kteří dokázali zasáhnout "
"bekasinu, anglicky „snipe“."

#. Key:	KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING24_DESCRIPTION
#. SourceLocation:
#. /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
#. InfoMetaData:   "Notes Localization" : "Tip seen on the Loading Screen, fun
#. fact tip24, reused from WotH1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"Version" : "Beta"
#: /Game/BASE/UI/Display_Game/UiScreen_Codex/ST_Guides.ST_Guides
msgctxt "ST_Encyclopedia,KEY_METAGAME_ENCYCLOPEDIA_TIPLOADING24_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Male reindeer shed their antlers at the beginning of winter while females "
"keep theirs through the winter, which implies that the antlered reindeer "
"pulling Santa's sleigh are all female!"
msgstr ""
"Samci sobů shazují paroží na začátku zimy, zatímco samice si je ponechávají "
"přes zimu. To by znamenalo, že všichni sobi s parožím, kteří táhnou Santovy "
"sáně, jsou samice!"
